{"project":{"indexOriginal":0,"gameEngine":"APPUI","files":{"/addons/VNTextPatch/vntextpatch.js":{"data":[["I have extracted the game data","He extraído los datos del juego"],["Load game's data folder","Cargar carpeta de datos del juego"],["Select the game's data folder","Seleccionar la carpeta de datos del juego"],["Engine Info","Información del motor"],["Currently detected engine","Motor detectado actualmente"],["Manually Specify Format","Especificar formato manualmente"],["Manually specify the game format.<br />VNTranslationTools will automatically detect the format based on the file extension. However, if you encounter ambiguous file extensions, please provide the format explicitly.","Especifica manualmente el formato del juego.<br />VNTranslationTools detectará automáticamente el formato basado en la extensión del archivo. Sin embargo, si encuentras extensiones de archivo ambiguas, por favor proporciona el formato explícitamente."],["Interface","Interfaz"],["VNTextPatch can parse the game into two formats: JSON or an XLSX spreadsheet. Please select the interface you want to use.","VNTextPatch puede analizar el juego en dos formatos: JSON o una hoja de cálculo XLSX. Por favor, selecciona la interfaz que deseas usar."],["Warning: There is a row limit if you're choosing XLSX spreadsheet.","Advertencia: Hay un límite de filas si eliges la hoja de cálculo XLSX."],["Create a new project","Crear un nuevo proyecto"],["Invalid destination directory:","Directorio de destino inválido:"],["Close","Cerrar"]],"context":[["tid/8164/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8228/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8233/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8246/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8251/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8256/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8261/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8266/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8271/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8276/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8455/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8516/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/11110/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"vntextpatch.js","dirname":"/addons/VNTextPatch","extension":".js","filename":"vntextpatch.js","path":"/addons/VNTextPatch/vntextpatch.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"I have extracted the game data":0,"Load game's data folder":1,"Select the game's data folder":2,"Engine Info":3,"Currently detected engine":4,"Manually Specify Format":5,"Manually specify the game format.<br />VNTranslationTools will automatically detect the format based on the file extension. However, if you encounter ambiguous file extensions, please provide the format explicitly.":6,"Interface":7,"VNTextPatch can parse the game into two formats: JSON or an XLSX spreadsheet. Please select the interface you want to use.":8,"Warning: There is a row limit if you're choosing XLSX spreadsheet.":9,"Create a new project":10,"Invalid destination directory:":11,"Close":12},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/actionEditorParser/ae4parser.js":{"data":[["Start translation from Action Editor 4 Game","Iniciar traducción desde Action Editor 4 Game"],["Create Project","Crear proyecto"]],"context":[["tid/920/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/997/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"ae4parser.js","dirname":"/addons/actionEditorParser","extension":".js","filename":"ae4parser.js","path":"/addons/actionEditorParser/ae4parser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Start translation from Action Editor 4 Game":0,"Create Project":1},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/adminTools/!post.html":{"data":[["Actions","Acciones"],["Build for 32bit system","Compilar para sistema de 32 bits"],["Build for non developer build too","Compilar también para compilación no de desarrollador"],["Custom Version","Versión personalizada"],["Custom version (leave blank to autogenerate version)","Versión personalizada (dejar en blanco para generar versión automáticamente)"],["Generate minor versioning?","¿Generar versionado menor?"],["Save patch to","Guardar parche en"],["Destination folder of generated patch","Carpeta de destino del parche generado"],["Overider template","Plantilla de sobrescritura"],["Release template","Plantilla de lanzamiento"],["Select file to be available live and excluded from the package","Seleccionar archivo para estar disponible en vivo y excluido del paquete"],["The file will be excluded from package, but available online","El archivo será excluido del paquete, pero disponible en línea"],["Make the process does not require user input","Hacer que el proceso no requiera entrada del usuario"],["Patch Type","Tipo de Parche"],["The file will be excluded from package, but available online. Select the file you want to substitute.","El archivo será excluido del paquete, pero disponible en línea. Seleccione el archivo que desea sustituir."],["Substitute trans.js with a fake one.","Sustituir trans.js con uno falso."],["Select Patch File","Seleccionar Archivo de Parche"],["Select the generated patch file (*.tpch).","Seleccione el archivo de parche generado (*.tpch)."],["Patches Links","Enlaces de Parches"],["Autoupdate will download from these links. <b>Must be direct download!</b> Separate each download link with newline.","La actualización automática descargará desde estos enlaces. <b>¡Deben ser enlaces de descarga directa!</b> Separe cada enlace de descarga con una nueva línea."],["Download Links","Enlaces de Descarga"],["Downloadable package for manual download. Separate each download link with newline.","Paquete descargable para descarga manual. Separe cada enlace de descarga con una nueva línea."],["Release Category","Categoría de Lanzamiento"],["Category of the release.","Categoría del lanzamiento."],["Upload log along with this submission.","Subir registro junto con este envío."],["Remove the same version found on database.","Eliminar la misma versión encontrada en la base de datos."],["Whether this release is enabled or not.","Si esta versión está habilitada o no."],["Whether this release is hidden or not. If a release is hidden. Only Administrators and member with <code>view_hidden_releases</code> (Developer) capability can install the release via package installer.","Si esta versión está oculta o no. Si una versión está oculta, solo los administradores y miembros con la capacidad <code>view_hidden_releases</code> (Desarrollador) pueden instalarla a través del instalador de paquetes."],["Release Name","Nombre de la Versión"],["Release Number","Número de la Versión"],["Release Date","Fecha de la Versión"],["Release Key","Clave de la Versión"],["Release Type","Tipo de Versión"],["CRC","CRC"],["Required Version","Versión Requerida"],["Minimum Version","Versión Mínima"],["Release Note","Notas de la Versión"],["Release Info","Información de la Versión"],["On Before Install","Antes de Instalar"],["On After Install","Después de Instalar"],["Extra parameters","Parámetros Extra"],["Remote file","Archivo Remoto"],["List of remote file, separate by new line","Lista de archivos remotos, separados por nueva línea"],["Patron Level","Nivel de Patrocinador"],["Post title","Título de la Publicación"],["Release post","Publicación de lanzamiento"],["Excerpt of the post","Extracto de la publicación"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText","idx/14/innerText","idx/29/innerText","idx/79/innerText"],["idx/2/innerText"],["idx/3/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText","idx/16/innerText"],["idx/5/innerText","idx/17/innerText"],["idx/6/innerText","idx/18/innerText"],["idx/7/innerText","idx/19/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText","idx/20/innerText"],["idx/9/innerText","idx/21/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText","idx/22/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText","idx/25/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText","idx/28/innerText"],["idx/23/innerText"],["idx/26/innerText"],["idx/27/innerText"],["idx/31/innerText"],["idx/32/innerText"],["idx/33/innerText"],["idx/34/innerText"],["idx/35/innerText"],["idx/36/innerText"],["idx/37/innerText"],["idx/38/innerText"],["idx/39/innerText"],["idx/40/innerText"],["idx/41/innerText"],["idx/42/innerText"],["idx/43/innerText"],["idx/45/innerText"],["idx/47/innerText"],["idx/49/innerText"],["idx/51/innerText"],["idx/53/innerText"],["idx/55/innerText"],["idx/57/innerText"],["idx/59/innerText"],["idx/61/innerText"],["idx/63/innerText"],["idx/65/innerText"],["idx/67/innerText"],["idx/69/innerText"],["idx/70/innerText"],["idx/71/innerText"],["idx/73/innerText"],["idx/75/innerText"],["idx/77/innerText"]],"basename":"!post.html","dirname":"/addons/adminTools","extension":".html","filename":"!post.html","path":"/addons/adminTools/!post.html","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Actions":0,"":1,"Build for 32bit system":1,"Build for non developer build too":2,"Custom Version":3,"Custom version (leave blank to autogenerate version)":4,"Generate minor versioning?":5,"Save patch to":6,"Destination folder of generated patch":7,"Overider template":8,"Release template":9,"Select file to be available live and excluded from the package":10,"The file will be excluded from package, but available online":11,"Make the process does not require user input":12,"Patch Type":13,"The file will be excluded from package, but available online. Select the file you want to substitute.":14,"Substitute trans.js with a fake one.":15,"Select Patch File":16,"Select the generated patch file (*.tpch).":17,"Patches Links":18,"Autoupdate will download from these links. <b>Must be direct download!</b> Separate each download link with newline.":19,"Download Links":20,"Downloadable package for manual download. Separate each download link with newline.":21,"Release Category":22,"Category of the release.":23,"Upload log along with this submission.":24,"Remove the same version found on database.":25,"Whether this release is enabled or not.":26,"Whether this release is hidden or not. If a release is hidden. Only Administrators and member with <code>view_hidden_releases</code> (Developer) capability can install the release via package installer.":27,"Release Name":28,"Release Number":29,"Release Date":30,"Release Key":31,"Release Type":32,"CRC":33,"Required Version":34,"Minimum Version":35,"Release Note":36,"Release Info":37,"On Before Install":38,"On After Install":39,"Extra parameters":40,"Remote file":41,"List of remote file, separate by new line":42,"Patron Level":43,"Post title":44,"Release post":45,"Excerpt of the post":46},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/adminTools/!postPackage.html":{"data":[["Select package json file","Seleccionar archivo json del paquete"],["Select the generated patch file","Seleccionar el archivo de parche generado"],["Or Select Destination File","O Seleccionar Archivo de Destino"],["Or Download location","O Ubicación de Descarga"],["Icon","Icono"],["Author","Autor"],["Name","Nombre"],["name of the package.","nombre del paquete."],["Title","Título"],["Title of the package.","Título del paquete."],["Version","Versión"],["Version of the package.","Versión del paquete."],["Description","Descripción"],["Description of the package.","Descripción del paquete."],["Whether this release is active or not.","Si este lanzamiento está activo o no."],["Whether this release is hidden or not.","Si este lanzamiento está oculto o no."],["Patron Level","Nivel de Patrocinador"],["Current month's pledge in $","Pago del mes actual en $"],["Patron Points","Puntos de Patrocinador"],["100pts = 1$","100pts = 1$"],["Purchase type","Tipo de compra"],["Type of the purchase.","Tipo de la compra."],["On Before Install","Antes de instalar"],["Javascript code to be run before install","Código Javascript para ejecutar antes de instalar"],["On After Install","Después de instalar"],["Javascript code to be run after install","Código Javascript para ejecutar después de instalar"],["Manifest","Manifiesto"],["Manifest data","Datos del manifiesto"],["Minimum version","Versión mínima"],["Minimum version of Translator++ to be able to insatall this addon.","Versión mínima de Translator++ para poder instalar este complemento."],["Release Date","Fecha de lanzamiento"],["Is parser changed?","¿Se cambió el analizador?"],["Mark as parser change. Would warn the user to backup their project before updating to this addon.","Marcar como cambio de analizador. Advertiría al usuario para respaldar su proyecto antes de actualizar a este complemento."],["Remove the same version found on database.","Eliminar la misma versión encontrada en la base de datos."],["Excluded files","Archivos excluidos"],["Files listed here will be excluded from the distribution packages","Los archivos listados aquí serán excluidos de los paquetes de distribución"],["Script URL","URL del script"],["Script of the URL.","Script de la URL."],["Upload script","Subir script"],["This script will be uploaded to the back-end and will be processed with [php]Scripts template script.\n\t\t\t\t\tTo use this feature:\n\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Create a wordpress page with <b>[php]Scripts template</b> template.<br>You can also set the patreon's requirement to view the post.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Add the url to the page into the package.json file with <b>l</b> GET parameter point to the local file.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFor example : <u>https://dreamsavior.net/script/translation-proxy/?l=/sub.js</u>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t\t","Este script se subirá al back-end y será procesado con la plantilla de script [php]Scripts.\n\t\t\t\t\tPara usar esta función:\n\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Crea una página de wordpress con la plantilla <b>[php]Scripts</b>.<br>También puedes establecer el requisito de patreon para ver la publicación.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Añade la URL de la página al archivo package.json con el parámetro GET <b>l</b> apuntando al archivo local.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tPor ejemplo: <u>https://dreamsavior.net/script/translation-proxy/?l=/sub.js</u>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t\t"],["Actions","Acciones"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"],["idx/1/innerText","idx/3/innerText"],["idx/2/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText"],["idx/6/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText"],["idx/14/innerText"],["idx/15/innerText"],["idx/16/innerText"],["idx/17/innerText"],["idx/18/innerText"],["idx/19/innerText"],["idx/20/innerText"],["idx/21/innerText"],["idx/22/innerText"],["idx/23/innerText"],["idx/24/innerText"],["idx/25/innerText"],["idx/26/innerText"],["idx/27/innerText"],["idx/28/innerText"],["idx/29/innerText"],["idx/30/innerText"],["idx/31/innerText"],["idx/32/innerText"],["idx/33/innerText"],["idx/34/innerText"],["idx/36/innerText"],["idx/37/innerText"],["idx/38/innerText"],["idx/39/innerText"],["idx/40/innerText"],["idx/41/innerText"],["idx/42/innerText"],["idx/43/innerText"],["idx/44/innerText"],["idx/47/innerText"]],"basename":"!postPackage.html","dirname":"/addons/adminTools","extension":".html","filename":"!postPackage.html","path":"/addons/adminTools/!postPackage.html","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Select package json file":0,"Select the generated patch file":1,"Or Select Destination File":2,"Or Download location":3,"":4,"Icon":4,"Author":5,"Name":6,"name of the package.":7,"Title":8,"Title of the package.":9,"Version":10,"Version of the package.":11,"Description":12,"Description of the package.":13,"Whether this release is active or not.":14,"Whether this release is hidden or not.":15,"Patron Level":16,"Current month's pledge in $":17,"Patron Points":18,"100pts = 1$":19,"Purchase type":20,"Type of the purchase.":21,"On Before Install":22,"Javascript code to be run before install":23,"On After Install":24,"Javascript code to be run after install":25,"Manifest":26,"Manifest data":27,"Minimum version":28,"Minimum version of Translator++ to be able to insatall this addon.":29,"Release Date":30,"Is parser changed?":31,"Mark as parser change. Would warn the user to backup their project before updating to this addon.":32,"Remove the same version found on database.":33,"Excluded files":34,"Files listed here will be excluded from the distribution packages":35,"Script URL":36,"Script of the URL.":37,"Upload script":38,"This script will be uploaded to the back-end and will be processed with [php]Scripts template script.\n\t\t\t\t\tTo use this feature:\n\t\t\t\t\t<ol>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Create a wordpress page with <b>[php]Scripts template</b> template.<br>You can also set the patreon's requirement to view the post.</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li>Add the url to the page into the package.json file with <b>l</b> GET parameter point to the local file.<br>\n\t\t\t\t\t\tFor example : <u>https://dreamsavior.net/script/translation-proxy/?l=/sub.js</u>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t</ol>\n\t\t\t\t":39,"Actions":40},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/adminTools/adminTools.js":{"data":[["Close","Cerrar"]],"context":[["tid/588/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"adminTools.js","dirname":"/addons/adminTools","extension":".js","filename":"adminTools.js","path":"/addons/adminTools/adminTools.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Close":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/aec/aec.js":{"data":[["Universal Archive Unpacker","Desempaquetador de Archivo Universal"]],"context":[["tid/1001/type/StringLiteral","tid/1239/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"aec.js","dirname":"/addons/aec","extension":".js","filename":"aec.js","path":"/addons/aec/aec.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Universal Archive Unpacker":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/bakinParser/bakin-proxy.js":{"data":[["Extract a Bakin game dictionary from data.rbpack, translate dic.txt, and patch the player automatically.","Extrae un diccionario de juego Bakin desde data.rbpack, traduce dic.txt y parchea el reproductor automáticamente."],["Create project","Crear proyecto"],["Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!","Error: customField no está definido. ¡Esto no debería pasar!"],["Please select the Bakin game executable.","Por favor, selecciona el ejecutable del juego Bakin."],["<h2>Proxy workflow</h2>","<h2>Flujo de trabajo del proxy</h2>"],["Translator++ unpacks data.rbpack into a temporary folder.","Translator++ desempaqueta data.rbpack en una carpeta temporal."],["Split Dictionary uses dump-split and creates one .txt file per source area by default.","Dividir Diccionario usa dump-split y crea un archivo .txt por área de origen por defecto."],["Merge Dictionary uses a single dic.txt.","Fusionar Diccionario usa un solo dic.txt."],["Injection merges split dictionaries back into data/dic.txt and patches the player executable.","Inyección fusiona los diccionarios divididos de nuevo en data/dic.txt y parchea el ejecutable del reproductor."],["Split Dictionary (default)","Dividir Diccionario (por defecto)"],["Merge Dictionary","Fusionar Diccionario"]],"context":[["tid/2860/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2929/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2966/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3002/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3253/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3266/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3277/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3288/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3299/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3383/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3393/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"bakin-proxy.js","dirname":"/addons/bakinParser","extension":".js","filename":"bakin-proxy.js","path":"/addons/bakinParser/bakin-proxy.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Extract a Bakin game dictionary from data.rbpack, translate dic.txt, and patch the player automatically.":0,"Create project":1,"Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!":2,"Please select the Bakin game executable.":3,"<h2>Proxy workflow</h2>":4,"Translator++ unpacks data.rbpack into a temporary folder.":5,"Split Dictionary uses dump-split and creates one .txt file per source area by default.":6,"Merge Dictionary uses a single dic.txt.":7,"Injection merges split dictionaries back into data/dic.txt and patches the player executable.":8,"Split Dictionary (default)":9,"Merge Dictionary":10},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/bakinParser/bakin-xlsx.js":{"data":[["Start a translation project from RPG Developer Bakin localization sheet (xlsx).","Iniciar un proyecto de traducción desde la hoja de localización de RPG Developer Bakin (xlsx)."],["Create project","Crear proyecto"],["Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!","Error: customField no está definido. ¡Esto no debería pasar!"],["Please select the entry point to translate.","Por favor, selecciona el punto de entrada para traducir."],["<h2>RPG Developer Bakin editor is required</h2>","<h2>Se requiere el editor de RPG Developer Bakin</h2>"],["RPG Developer Bakin editor is required to start the translation project.","Se requiere el editor de RPG Developer Bakin para iniciar el proyecto de traducción."],["<h2>Before you start</h2>","<h2>Antes de comenzar</h2>"],["<a href=\"#\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.bakinParser.openDecompileForm()\">Unpack your game</a> into editable RPG Developer Bakin's project.","<a href=\"#\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.bakinParser.openDecompileForm()\">Desempaqueta tu juego</a> en un proyecto editable de RPG Developer Bakin."],["Export the localization strings by using RPG Developer Bakin application into a xlsx file. <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/docs/rpg-developer-bakin/how-to-translate-rpg-developer-bakin/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"true\">See the guide here on how to translate Bakin game</a>.","Exporta las cadenas de localización usando la aplicación RPG Developer Bakin a un archivo xlsx. <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/docs/rpg-developer-bakin/how-to-translate-rpg-developer-bakin/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"true\">Consulta la guía aquí sobre cómo traducir juegos de Bakin</a>."]],"context":[["tid/614/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/683/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/720/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/756/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1034/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1041/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1064/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1077/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1088/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"bakin-xlsx.js","dirname":"/addons/bakinParser","extension":".js","filename":"bakin-xlsx.js","path":"/addons/bakinParser/bakin-xlsx.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Start a translation project from RPG Developer Bakin localization sheet (xlsx).":0,"Create project":1,"Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!":2,"Please select the entry point to translate.":3,"<h2>RPG Developer Bakin editor is required</h2>":4,"RPG Developer Bakin editor is required to start the translation project.":5,"<h2>Before you start</h2>":6,"<a href=\"#\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.bakinParser.openDecompileForm()\">Unpack your game</a> into editable RPG Developer Bakin's project.":7,"Export the localization strings by using RPG Developer Bakin application into a xlsx file. <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/docs/rpg-developer-bakin/how-to-translate-rpg-developer-bakin/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"true\">See the guide here on how to translate Bakin game</a>.":8},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/basicUtils.js":{"data":[["NWJS Version","Versión de NWJS"],["Change into this NWJS version","Cambiar a esta versión de NWJS"],["Use Developer version","Usar versión de Desarrollador"],["Use the NWJS Developer version. The Developer version has developer tools available. Suitable for debugging and development.","Usa la versión de Desarrollador de NWJS. La versión de Desarrollador tiene herramientas de desarrollo disponibles. Adecuada para depuración y desarrollo."],["In Developer version you can use <b>Developer Console</b>. Developer Console can be accessed by pressing F12 or right-clicking the app and selecting 'Inspect'.","En la versión de Desarrollador puedes usar la <b>Consola de Desarrollador</b>. La Consola de Desarrollador se puede acceder presionando F12 o haciendo clic derecho en la aplicación y seleccionando 'Inspeccionar'."],["Use 32-bit version","Usar versión de 32 bits"],["Use the 32-bit version of NWJS. The 32-bit version is useful for compatibility with older systems. It is recommended to uncheck this option if possible (just upgrade your machine, dude).","Usa la versión de 32 bits de NWJS. La versión de 32 bits es útil para compatibilidad con sistemas antiguos. Se recomienda desmarcar esta opción si es posible (solo actualiza tu máquina, amigo)."],["Some Translator++ feature may not work across NWJS version","Algunas funciones de Translator++ pueden no funcionar entre versiones de NWJS"],["Please be aware that some Translator++ feature may not work across NWJS version. Make sure to test your project after changing the NWJS version.","Ten en cuenta que algunas funciones de Translator++ pueden no funcionar entre versiones de NWJS. Asegúrate de probar tu proyecto después de cambiar la versión de NWJS."],["You're currently running on NWJS ver.","Actualmente estás ejecutando en NWJS ver."],["Change Translator++ Core NWJS version","Cambiar versión de NWJS del núcleo de Translator++"],["You're already using the selected NWJS version.","Ya estás usando la versión de NWJS seleccionada."],["This operation will close Translator++ and change the current NW.js version into","Esta operación cerrará Translator++ y cambiará la versión actual de NW.js a"],["If you have any unsaved changes, please select 'Cancel' and save your project first.\nDo you want to continue?","Si tienes cambios no guardados, selecciona 'Cancelar' y guarda tu proyecto primero.\n¿Deseas continuar?"]],"context":[["tid/1342/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1352/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1428/type/StringLiteral","tid/1617/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1438/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1449/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1482/type/StringLiteral","tid/1641/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1492/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1532/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1537/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1542/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1669/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1745/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1769/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1782/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"basicUtils.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils","extension":".js","filename":"basicUtils.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/basicUtils.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"NWJS Version":0,"Change into this NWJS version":1,"Use Developer version":2,"Use the NWJS Developer version. The Developer version has developer tools available. Suitable for debugging and development.":3,"In Developer version you can use <b>Developer Console</b>. Developer Console can be accessed by pressing F12 or right-clicking the app and selecting 'Inspect'.":4,"Use 32-bit version":5,"Use the 32-bit version of NWJS. The 32-bit version is useful for compatibility with older systems. It is recommended to uncheck this option if possible (just upgrade your machine, dude).":6,"Some Translator++ feature may not work across NWJS version":7,"Please be aware that some Translator++ feature may not work across NWJS version. Make sure to test your project after changing the NWJS version.":8,"You're currently running on NWJS ver.":9,"Change Translator++ Core NWJS version":10,"You're already using the selected NWJS version.":11,"This operation will close Translator++ and change the current NW.js version into":12,"If you have any unsaved changes, please select 'Cancel' and save your project first.\nDo you want to continue?":13},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/mainMenu.js":{"data":[["Change Language","Cambiar Idioma"],["No MTL available for this language pair","No hay MTL disponible para este par de idiomas"],["Change default MTL for this project","Cambiar MTL predeterminado para este proyecto"],["???","???"],["Search in a folder","Buscar en una carpeta"],["Search in Staging Files","Buscar en Archivos de Ensayo"],["Search in Original Files","Buscar en Archivos Originales"],["No original files path is set for this project.","No se ha configurado una ruta de archivos originales para este proyecto."],["Search in Translated Files","Buscar en Archivos Traducidos"],["No translated files path is set for this project.\nYou need to inject your translation once to set the translated files path.","No se ha configurado una ruta de archivos traducidos para este proyecto.\nNecesitas inyectar tu traducción una vez para establecer la ruta de archivos traducidos."],["Chat with AI Assistant","Chatear con el Asistente de IA"],["AI Assistant is not available since the new features are not loaded.\nPlease reinstall or re-update Translator++.","El Asistente de IA no está disponible ya que las nuevas funciones no están cargadas.\nPor favor, reinstala o actualiza nuevamente Translator++."]],"context":[["tid/442/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/729/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/974/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1182/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1339/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1404/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1501/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1539/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1624/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1662/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1777/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1812/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"mainMenu.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils","extension":".js","filename":"mainMenu.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/mainMenu.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Change Language":0,"No MTL available for this language pair":1,"Change default MTL for this project":2,"???":3,"Search in a folder":4,"Search in Staging Files":5,"Search in Original Files":6,"No original files path is set for this project.":7,"Search in Translated Files":8,"No translated files path is set for this project.\nYou need to inject your translation once to set the translated files path.":9,"Chat with AI Assistant":10,"AI Assistant is not available since the new features are not loaded.\nPlease reinstall or re-update Translator++.":11},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/utils/HTMLPacker.js":{"data":[["Path is not a file:","La ruta no es un archivo:"],["Icon path is not a file:","La ruta del icono no es un archivo:"],["Path is not an exe file:","La ruta no es un archivo ejecutable:"],["Icon path is not an ico file:","La ruta del icono no es un archivo .ico:"],["Html entry point","Punto de entrada HTML"],["Select the html entry point file (usually index.html)","Selecciona el archivo punto de entrada HTML (normalmente index.html)"],["Destination folder","Carpeta de destino"],["Select destination folder. The process will replace the existing files.","Selecciona la carpeta de destino. El proceso reemplazará los archivos existentes."],["NWJS version","Versión de NWJS"],["Optional. Select NWJS version and architecture.<br />Latest version not always better, just use what works for you.","Opcional. Selecciona la versión y arquitectura de NWJS.<br />La última versión no siempre es mejor, usa lo que funcione para ti."],["Application ID","ID de la aplicación"],["Set the application ID for the game. The ID must be in lowercase and can only contain letters, numbers, and underscores.","Configura el ID de la aplicación para el juego. El ID debe estar en minúsculas y solo puede contener letras, números y guiones bajos."],["Application description","Descripción de la aplicación"],["Set the application description for the game.","Configura la descripción de la aplicación para el juego."],["Window title","Título de la ventana"],["Set the default window title for the game.<br />This value may be overridden by the game engine.","Configura el título predeterminado de la ventana para el juego.<br />Este valor puede ser sobrescrito por el motor del juego."],["Window width","Ancho de la ventana"],["Set the default window width for the game.","Configura el ancho predeterminado de la ventana para el juego."],["Window height","Altura de la ventana"],["Set the default window height for the game.","Configura la altura predeterminada de la ventana para el juego."],["Full screen","Pantalla completa"],["Set the game to start in full screen mode.","Configura el juego para iniciar en modo de pantalla completa."],["Resizable","Redimensionable"],["Set the game window to be resizable.","Configura la ventana del juego para que sea redimensionable."],["Game icon","Icono del juego"],["Select the icon file for the game executable. The icon file must be in .ico format. The icon will be embedded in the game executable.","Selecciona el archivo de icono para el ejecutable del juego. El archivo de icono debe estar en formato .ico. El icono se incrustará en el ejecutable del juego."],["Through this form, you can create a playable package of your game. <br />The process will replace the existing files in the destination folder.","A través de este formulario, puedes crear un paquete jugable de tu juego. <br />El proceso reemplazará los archivos existentes en la carpeta de destino."],["Start the application in full screen mode","Iniciar la aplicación en modo de pantalla completa"],["Allow the application to be resizable","Permitir que la aplicación sea redimensionable"],["HTML Compiler","Compilador HTML"],["Compile","Compilar"],["Source path can not empty","La ruta de origen no puede estar vacía"],["Destination path can not empty","La ruta de destino no puede estar vacía"]],"context":[["tid/86/type/StringLiteral","tid/4136/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/116/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/151/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/186/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2424/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2434/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2474/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2484/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2524/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2534/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2587/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2597/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2631/type/StringLiteral","tid/3795/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2641/type/StringLiteral","tid/3805/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2675/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2685/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2722/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2732/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2766/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2776/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2810/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2820/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2854/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2864/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2899/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2909/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2950/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3900/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3924/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4020/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4037/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4083/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4104/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"HTMLPacker.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils/utils","extension":".js","filename":"HTMLPacker.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/HTMLPacker.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Path is not a file:":0,"Icon path is not a file:":1,"Path is not an exe file:":2,"Icon path is not an ico file:":3,"Html entry point":4,"Select the html entry point file (usually index.html)":5,"Destination folder":6,"Select destination folder. The process will replace the existing files.":7,"NWJS version":8,"Optional. Select NWJS version and architecture.<br />Latest version not always better, just use what works for you.":9,"Application ID":10,"Set the application ID for the game. The ID must be in lowercase and can only contain letters, numbers, and underscores.":11,"Application description":12,"Set the application description for the game.":13,"Window title":14,"Set the default window title for the game.<br />This value may be overridden by the game engine.":15,"Window width":16,"Set the default window width for the game.":17,"Window height":18,"Set the default window height for the game.":19,"Full screen":20,"Set the game to start in full screen mode.":21,"Resizable":22,"Set the game window to be resizable.":23,"Game icon":24,"Select the icon file for the game executable. The icon file must be in .ico format. The icon will be embedded in the game executable.":25,"Through this form, you can create a playable package of your game. <br />The process will replace the existing files in the destination folder.":26,"Start the application in full screen mode":27,"Allow the application to be resizable":28,"HTML Compiler":29,"Compile":30,"Source path can not empty":31,"Destination path can not empty":32},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/utils/Updater.js":{"data":[["An update is being installed. Please do not close the application until the installation is completed.","Se está instalando una actualización. Por favor, no cierres la aplicación hasta que la instalación se complete."],["Package Path","Ruta del Paquete"],["Select the package file.","Selecciona el archivo del paquete."],["Package Key","Clave del Paquete"],["If you have the key, please enter it here. If not, leave it empty.","Si tienes la clave, ingrésala aquí. Si no, déjalo vacío."],["Through this form, you can update Translator++ with the updater package file. You can download the updater package <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/translator-plusplus/translator-update-package/\" external>here</a>.","A través de este formulario, puedes actualizar Translator++ con el archivo de paquete de actualización. Puedes descargar el paquete de actualización <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/translator-plusplus/translator-update-package/\" external>aquí</a>."],["Update from package","Actualizar desde paquete"],["Update","Actualizar"],["Update Translator++","Actualizar Translator++"]],"context":[["tid/4918/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6562/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6572/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6612/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6622/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6661/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/6753/type/StringLiteral","tid/7195/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6770/type/StringLiteral","tid/7091/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7120/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"Updater.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils/utils","extension":".js","filename":"Updater.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/Updater.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"An update is being installed. Please do not close the application until the installation is completed.":0,"Package Path":1,"Select the package file.":2,"Package Key":3,"If you have the key, please enter it here. If not, leave it empty.":4,"Through this form, you can update Translator++ with the updater package file. You can download the updater package <a href=\"https://dreamsavior.net/translator-plusplus/translator-update-package/\" external>here</a>.":5,"Update from package":6,"Update":7,"Update Translator++":8},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/utils/info.js":{"data":[["You have ","Tienes "],[" missed update(s)!"," actualización(es) perdida(s)!"],["Translator++ will update itself if auto-update is enabled.","Translator++ se actualizará automáticamente si la auto-actualización está habilitada."],["You can download the latest core version of Translator++ at","Puedes descargar la última versión principal de Translator++ en"],["This update is available for all patrons.","Esta actualización está disponible para todos los patrocinadores."],["This update is available for tier $","Esta actualización está disponible para patrocinadores de nivel $"],[" patrons or greater."," o superior."],["You're up-to-date!","¡Estás actualizado!"],["Thanks for staying up to date with Translator++! You're on the newest version, and we appreciate your support. Enjoy translating!","¡Gracias por mantenerte al día con Translator++! Estás en la versión más nueva, y apreciamos tu apoyo. ¡Disfruta traduciendo!"],["Some update information may be shown from cache. You can click <b>'Check for update'</b> to load the latest version details.","Alguna información de actualización puede mostrarse desde la caché. Puedes hacer clic en <b>'Verificar actualización'</b> para cargar los detalles de la última versión."],["When the same version is available","Cuando la misma versión está disponible"],["Allow Translator++ to reinstall the same version of Translator++.","Permitir que Translator++ reinstale la misma versión de Translator++."],["Allow reinstall the same version","Permitir reinstalar la misma versión"],["Update Settings","Configuración de Actualización"],["Update Now","Actualizar Ahora"],["Updater is not available, please update Translator++ manually.","El actualizador no está disponible, por favor actualiza Translator++ manualmente."],["Updating Translator++","Actualizando Translator++"],["Please don't close Translator++ until the update process is finished.","Por favor no cierres Translator++ hasta que el proceso de actualización termine."],["Can not update, reason :\n","No se puede actualizar, razón :\n"],["You may need to reconnect Translator++ with your Patreon account (logout and login again).","Puede que necesites reconectar Translator++ con tu cuenta de Patreon (cerrar sesión e iniciar sesión de nuevo)."],["Also, it has been reported that some countries such as mainland China are blocking dropbox repository.","Además, se ha reportado que algunos países como China continental están bloqueando el repositorio de Dropbox."],["If for some reason you cannot access our repository, please manually download the update package (tpch file) using a proxy or VPN here:","Si por alguna razón no puedes acceder a nuestro repositorio, por favor descarga manualmente el paquete de actualización (archivo tpch) usando un proxy o VPN aquí:"],["After that, please use the \"Update from package\" feature to update your Translator++.","Después de eso, por favor usa la función \"Actualizar desde paquete\" para actualizar tu Translator++."],["If you still have problems, please contact us at our Discord server : ","Si aún tienes problemas, por favor contáctanos en nuestro servidor de Discord: "],["Restart","Reiniciar"],["Do you want to restart Translator++ now?\nIf you have unsaved work, cancel this dialog and save your work first.","¿Quieres reiniciar Translator++ ahora?\nSi tienes trabajo sin guardar, cancela este diálogo y guarda tu trabajo primero."],["Check for Update","Verificar Actualización"],["Close","Cerrar"]],"context":[["tid/649/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/660/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/665/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/670/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1033/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1077/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1088/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1665/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1670/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1675/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1755/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1765/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1811/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1873/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2021/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2066/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2116/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2130/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2176/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2192/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2206/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2220/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2245/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2259/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2357/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2377/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2449/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2512/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"info.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils/utils","extension":".js","filename":"info.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/info.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"You have ":0," missed update(s)!":1,"Translator++ will update itself if auto-update is enabled.":2,"You can download the latest core version of Translator++ at":3,"This update is available for all patrons.":4,"This update is available for tier $":5," patrons or greater.":6,"You're up-to-date!":7,"Thanks for staying up to date with Translator++! You're on the newest version, and we appreciate your support. Enjoy translating!":8,"Some update information may be shown from cache. You can click <b>'Check for update'</b> to load the latest version details.":9,"When the same version is available":10,"Allow Translator++ to reinstall the same version of Translator++.":11,"Allow reinstall the same version":12,"Update Settings":13,"Update Now":14,"Updater is not available, please update Translator++ manually.":15,"Updating Translator++":16,"Please don't close Translator++ until the update process is finished.":17,"Can not update, reason :\n":18,"You may need to reconnect Translator++ with your Patreon account (logout and login again).":19,"Also, it has been reported that some countries such as mainland China are blocking dropbox repository.":20,"If for some reason you cannot access our repository, please manually download the update package (tpch file) using a proxy or VPN here:":21,"After that, please use the \"Update from package\" feature to update your Translator++.":22,"If you still have problems, please contact us at our Discord server : ":23,"Restart":24,"Do you want to restart Translator++ now?\nIf you have unsaved work, cancel this dialog and save your work first.":25,"Check for Update":26,"Close":27},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/basicUtils/utils/uiTags.js":{"data":[["Do not process row with selected tag (blacklist)","No procesar fila con etiqueta seleccionada (lista negra)"],["Only process row with selected tag (whitelist)","Solo procesar fila con etiqueta seleccionada (lista blanca)"],["Ignore tag","Ignorar etiqueta"],["Load last selection","Cargar última selección"],["Reset","Reiniciar"],["Cancel","Cancelar"],["Confirm","Confirmar"]],"context":[["tid/55/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/60/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/65/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/410/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/415/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2085/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2137/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"uiTags.js","dirname":"/addons/basicUtils/utils","extension":".js","filename":"uiTags.js","path":"/addons/basicUtils/utils/uiTags.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Do not process row with selected tag (blacklist)":0,"Only process row with selected tag (whitelist)":1,"Ignore tag":2,"Load last selection":3,"Reset":4,"Cancel":5,"Confirm":6},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/customParser/CustomParserLoader.js":{"data":[["List of the possible character encodings. <b>Order does matter!</b>. Separate each value with a comma.<br />Translator++ will read the original file with the following encodings, patch the files and write with the <b>Write Character encoding</b> option. Leave blank to use the original character encoding when the project is created.","Lista de las posibles codificaciones de caracteres. <b>¡El orden importa!</b>. Separe cada valor con una coma.<br />Translator++ leerá el archivo original con las siguientes codificaciones, parcheará los archivos y escribirá con la opción <b>Codificación de caracteres de escritura</b>. Deje en blanco para usar la codificación de caracteres original cuando se crea el proyecto."],["For BOM support, add a space after the encoding. Example: <code>utf8 bom</code>","Para soporte de BOM, agregue un espacio después de la codificación. Ejemplo: <code>utf8 bom</code>"],["Example: utf8,utf8 bom,utf16le,ascii","Ejemplo: utf8,utf8 bom,utf16le,ascii"],["Select the target character encoding.","Seleccione la codificación de caracteres objetivo."]],"context":[["tid/3375/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3383/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3392/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4740/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"CustomParserLoader.js","dirname":"/addons/customParser","extension":".js","filename":"CustomParserLoader.js","path":"/addons/customParser/CustomParserLoader.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"List of the possible character encodings. <b>Order does matter!</b>. Separate each value with a comma.<br />Translator++ will read the original file with the following encodings, patch the files and write with the <b>Write Character encoding</b> option. Leave blank to use the original character encoding when the project is created.":0,"For BOM support, add a space after the encoding. Example: <code>utf8 bom</code>":1,"Example: utf8,utf8 bom,utf16le,ascii":2,"Select the target character encoding.":3},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/customParser/modelEditor/modelEditor.html":{"data":[["<i class=\"icon-edit\"></i>","<i class=\"icon-edit\"></i>"],["<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Add a new file group</label>","<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Agregar un nuevo grupo de archivos</label>"],["Add a new file group","Agregar un nuevo grupo de archivos"],["<i class=\"icon-cancel-circled red\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Remove current file group</label>","<i class=\"icon-cancel-circled red\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Eliminar grupo de archivos actual</label>"],["Remove current file group","Eliminar grupo de archivos actual"],["Rules","Reglas"],["Hooks","Ganchos"],["Options","Opciones"],["Testing","Prueba"],["Interpolate the strings before being displayed on the cells. <b>To Grid</b> is antithesis of <b>From Grid</b>","Interpola las cadenas antes de mostrarlas en las celdas. <b>Hacia la Cuadrícula</b> es la antítesis de <b>Desde la Cuadrícula</b>"],["Example","Ejemplo"],["For example, the text obtained from the parser is as follows:","Por ejemplo, el texto obtenido del analizador es el siguiente:"],["In this grid it will look like this:","En esta cuadrícula se verá así:"],["That's not the easiest text to work with.<br>\n  We can fix that by declaring <span class=\"inlineCode\">To Grid hooks</span> as follows:\n","Ese no es el texto más fácil de trabajar.<br>\n  Podemos arreglarlo declarando <span class=\"inlineCode\">Ganchos Hacia la Cuadrícula</span> de la siguiente manera:\n"],["With the hook above the text in the grid will be :","Con el gancho anterior, el texto en la cuadrícula será:"],["Interpolate the strings from the cells into the translation result. <b>From Grid</b> is antithesis of <b>To Grid</b>.","Interpola las cadenas desde las celdas hacia el resultado de la traducción. <b>Desde la Cuadrícula</b> es la antítesis de <b>Hacia la Cuadrícula</b>."],["\n  For example, the expected translated strings should be in JSON format.<br>\n  But writing translation in JSON format is not realy the easiest thing to do. <br>\n  So, instead of asking our translator to translate in JSON format, we can just ask them to type normally, and add a <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid hook</span> as follows:\n","\n  Por ejemplo, las cadenas traducidas esperadas deberían estar en formato JSON.<br>\n  Pero escribir la traducción en formato JSON no es realmente lo más fácil de hacer. <br>\n  Entonces, en lugar de pedirle a nuestro traductor que traduzca en formato JSON, podemos simplemente pedirle que escriba normalmente, y agregar un <span class=\"inlineCode\">Gancho Desde la Cuadrícula</span> de la siguiente manera:\n"],["\n  With the <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid hook</span> above, the following translation ...\n","\n  Con el <span class=\"inlineCode\">Gancho Desde la Cuadrícula</span> anterior, la siguiente traducción ...\n"],["...will be converted into desired format: ","...se convertirá en el formato deseado: "],["Edit the translated text just before writing it into a file.","Edita el texto traducido justo antes de escribirlo en un archivo."],["Parameters","Parámetros"],["\n              <h3 data-tran=\"\">text</h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The text that is about to be written into a file.</p>\n            ","\n              <h3 data-tran=\"\">texto</h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">El texto que está a punto de escribirse en un archivo.</p>\n            "],["text","texto"],["The text that is about to be written into a file.","El texto que está a punto de escribirse en un archivo."],["Return value","Valor de retorno"],["\n              <h3><i>String</i></h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The text that will be written into a file.</p>\n            ","\n              <h3><i>Cadena</i></h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">El texto que se escribirá en un archivo.</p>\n            "],["The text that will be written into a file.","El texto que se escribirá en un archivo."],["General","General"],["Read character encoding","Codificación de caracteres de lectura"],["Force parser to use the following character encoding when reading the file(s).","Forzar al analizador a usar la siguiente codificación de caracteres al leer el/los archivo(s)."],["Write character encoding","Codificación de caracteres de escritura"],["Force parser to use the following character encoding when writing the file(s).","Forzar al analizador a usar la siguiente codificación de caracteres al escribir el/los archivo(s)."],["You are editing:","Estás editando:"],["Please select the mode of your pattern","Por favor, selecciona el modo de tu patrón"],["Regular expression Pattern","Patrón de expresión regular"],["A valid ECMA Script's regular expression along with the modifier.<br>You can use <a href=\"https://regex101.com/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"\">regex101.com</a> to create and test your pattern.","Una expresión regular válida de ECMA Script junto con el modificador.<br>Puedes usar <a href=\"https://regex101.com/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"\">regex101.com</a> para crear y probar tu patrón."],["Pay attention to the use of carriage return (\\r) in the text to be translated. regex101.com will strip out the carriage returns so your pattern may have a different effect than what you see on regex101. ","Presta atención al uso de retorno de carro (\\r) en el texto a traducir. regex101.com eliminará los retornos de carro, por lo que tu patrón puede tener un efecto diferente al que ves en regex101."],["<strong>About quantifier that captures a zero length string.</strong><br>\n            <i>Null</i> strings will cause problems for the parser. Therefore, instead of using the <strong>*</strong> quantifier which will also capture <i>nulls</i>, it is highly recommended to use the <strong>+</strong> quantifier which will only capture strings if exist.","<strong>Sobre el cuantificador que captura una cadena de longitud cero.</strong><br>\n            Las cadenas <i>nulas</i> causarán problemas para el analizador. Por lo tanto, en lugar de usar el cuantificador <strong>*</strong> que también captura <i>nulos</i>, se recomienda encarecidamente usar el cuantificador <strong>+</strong> que solo captura cadenas si existen."],["Translatable Capture groups","Grupos de captura traducibles"],["Index of the regular expression's groups (Integer) for the translatable texts. Can be more than one. Separate with comma.","Índice de los grupos de la expresión regular (Entero) para los textos traducibles. Puede ser más de uno. Separar con coma."],["Row Info Capture group","Grupo de captura de información de fila"],["\n            Index of the regular expression's group (Integer) for the row info (e.g. character name). <b>Only one group</b> is allowed. <br>\n            The value of the Row info can be carried over to the child rules and will be overwritten by the child rule's Row info value if exist.\n          ","\n            Índice del grupo de la expresión regular (Entero) para la información de fila (por ejemplo, nombre del personaje). <b>Solo se permite un grupo</b>. <br>\n            El valor de la información de fila puede transmitirse a las reglas hijas y será sobrescrito por el valor de información de fila de la regla hija si existe.\n          "],["Context template","Plantilla de contexto"],["\n            Context is unique identifier for translatable texts. <br>\n            You can use Javascript's template literals to add information to the context.<br>\n            <b>Available variable:</b>\n            <ul>\n              <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">GROUP[<i>n</i>]</span> - Group capture.</li>\n              <!-- <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">RULE_ID</span> - The ID of the rule.</li> -->\n            </ul>\n            <br>\n            <b>Example:</b>\n            <pre>item/${GROUP[2]}</pre>\n          ","\n            El contexto es un identificador único para textos traducibles. <br>\n            Puedes usar literales de plantilla de Javascript para agregar información al contexto.<br>\n            <b>Variable disponible:</b>\n            <ul>\n              <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">GRUPO[<i>n</i>]</span> - Captura de grupo.</li>\n              <!-- <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">ID_REGLA</span> - El ID de la regla.</li> -->\n            </ul>\n            <br>\n            <b>Ejemplo:</b>\n            <pre>item/${GRUPO[2]}</pre>\n          "],["Action","Acción"],["Capture value","Capturar valor"],["Capture then mask value","Capturar y luego enmascarar valor"],["Mask value","Enmascarar valor"],["Send to inner rule","Enviar a regla interna"],["Edit inner rule <i class=\"icon-angle-double-right\"></i>","Editar regla interna <i class=\"icon-angle-double-right\"></i>"],["What action the pattern is going to do.","Qué acción va a realizar el patrón."],["Javascript function","Función de Javascript"],["Guide","Guía"],["\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Arguments</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">The code you write will be inside a function with 2 arguments that can be accessed anywhere in your code:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>\n              <h3>text</h3>\n              <p><b>String</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">A string of the entire content of the file.</p>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <h3>thisModel</h3>\n              <p><b>Object</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The rule object that is currently used by the file.</p>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\"><i>this</i> Keyword</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\"><b>this</b> will reffer to the instance of CustomParser class.</p>\n\n        ","\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Argumentos</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">El código que escribas estará dentro de una función con 2 argumentos a los que se puede acceder en cualquier parte de tu código:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>\n              <h3>texto</h3>\n              <p><b>Cadena</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">Una cadena con todo el contenido del archivo.</p>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <h3>esteModelo</h3>\n              <p><b>Objeto</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">El objeto de regla que está siendo usado actualmente por el archivo.</p>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Palabra clave <i>this</i></h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\"><b>this</b> se referirá a la instancia de la clase CustomParser.</p>\n\n        "],["Arguments","Argumentos"],["The code you write will be inside a function with 2 arguments that can be accessed anywhere in your code:","El código que escribas estará dentro de una función con 2 argumentos a los que se puede acceder en cualquier parte de tu código:"],["A string of the entire content of the file.","Una cadena con todo el contenido del archivo."],["The rule object that is currently used by the file.","El objeto de regla que está siendo usado actualmente por el archivo."],["<i>this</i> Keyword","Palabra clave <i>this</i>"],["<b>this</b> will reffer to the instance of CustomParser class.","<b>this</b> se referirá a la instancia de la clase CustomParser."],["\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Expected Return Value</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">Your code must <b>return</b> one of the following value:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li><pre>undefined</pre></li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", // Character name. optional\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // Context. optional\n  }\n</pre>\n            </li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Array of the offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"Another Character\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"Third Character\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        ","\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Valor de retorno esperado</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">Tu código debe <b>devolver</b> uno de los siguientes valores:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li><pre>indefinido</pre></li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Desplazamiento del texto capturado, por ejemplo:\n<pre>  {\n    inicio:100,\n    fin:120,\n    textoInfoFila:\"Nombre del Personaje\", // Nombre del personaje. opcional\n    contexto: [\"algo\", \"contexto\", \"aquí\"] // Contexto. opcional\n  }\n</pre>\n            </li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Arreglo del desplazamiento del texto capturado, por ejemplo:\n<pre>  [\n    {inicio:0, fin:5, textoInfoFila:\"Nombre del Personaje\", contexto: [\"algo\", \"contexto\", \"aquí\"]},\n    {inicio:12, fin:30, textoInfoFila:\"Otro Personaje\", contexto: [\"otro\", \"contexto\"]},\n    {inicio:4581, fin:4593, textoInfoFila:\"Tercer Personaje\", contexto: [\"tercero\", \"contexto\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        "],["Expected Return Value","Valor de retorno esperado"],["Your code must <b>return</b> one of the following value:","Tu código debe <b>devolver</b> uno de los siguientes valores:"],["Offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", // Character name. optional\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // Context. optional\n  }\n</pre>\n            ","Desplazamiento del texto capturado, por ejemplo:\n<pre>  {\n    inicio:100,\n    fin:120,\n    textoInfoFila:\"Nombre del Personaje\", // Nombre del personaje. opcional\n    contexto: [\"algo\", \"contexto\", \"aquí\"] // Contexto. opcional\n  }\n</pre>\n            "],["Array of the offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"Another Character\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"Third Character\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            ","Arreglo del desplazamiento del texto capturado, por ejemplo:\n<pre>  [\n    {inicio:0, fin:5, textoInfoFila:\"Nombre del Personaje\", contexto: [\"algo\", \"contexto\", \"aquí\"]},\n    {inicio:12, fin:30, textoInfoFila:\"Otro Personaje\", contexto: [\"otro\", \"contexto\"]},\n    {inicio:4581, fin:4593, textoInfoFila:\"Tercer Personaje\", contexto: [\"tercero\", \"contexto\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            "],["\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Example</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">The following code is an example to parse srt subtitle.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">\n/*\n  Translator++ is using regexp-match-indices\n  by that all RegExp.exec() method will return their group offset\n  read more about Regular Expression Indices here: https://v8.dev/features/regexp-match-indices\n*/\n\nvar result \t\t\t= [];\nvar captureGroup \t= 1;\nvar regex \t\t\t= /\\d+[\\r\\n]+\\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+ --&gt; \\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+[\\r\\n]+((.+\\r?\\n)+(?=(\\r?\\n)?))/g;\nwhile(null != (matches=regex.exec(text))) {\n  console.log(matches);\n  if (!matches?.indices?.[captureGroup]) continue;\n  result.push({\n    start\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][0],\n    end\t\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][1]\n  })\n}\nreturn result;             \n</code>\n</pre>\n        ","\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Ejemplo</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">El siguiente código es un ejemplo para analizar subtítulos srt.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">\n/*\n  Translator++ usa regexp-match-indices\n  por lo que todos los métodos RegExp.exec() devolverán el desplazamiento de sus grupos\n  lee más sobre Índices de Expresiones Regulares aquí: https://v8.dev/features/regexp-match-indices\n*/\n\nvar resultado \t\t= [];\nvar grupoCaptura \t= 1;\nvar regex \t\t\t= /\\d+[\\r\\n]+\\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+ --&gt; \\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+[\\r\\n]+((.+\\r?\\n)+(?=(\\r?\\n)?))/g;\nwhile(null != (coincidencias=regex.exec(texto))) {\n  console.log(coincidencias);\n  if (!coincidencias?.indices?.[grupoCaptura]) continue;\n  resultado.push({\n    inicio\t: coincidencias.indices[grupoCaptura][0],\n    fin\t\t: coincidencias.indices[grupoCaptura][1]\n  })\n}\ndevolver resultado;             \n</code>\n</pre>\n        "],["The following code is an example to parse srt subtitle.","El siguiente código es un ejemplo para analizar subtítulos srt."],["Welcome to the Custom Parser Model Creator","Bienvenido al Creador de Modelos de Analizador Personalizado"],["Please start by creating a new File Group.","Por favor, comienza creando un nuevo Grupo de Archivos."],["Please define what kind of file you want to parse by clicking\n      <button class=\"addFileGroup\" onclick=\"addFileGroup(this)\"><i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i>Add a new file group</button> button.\n    ","Por favor, define qué tipo de archivo quieres analizar haciendo clic en el botón\n      <button class=\"addFileGroup\" onclick=\"addFileGroup(this)\"><i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i>Añadir un nuevo grupo de archivos</button>.\n    "],["Press F1 to open the help dialog.","Presiona F1 para abrir el diálogo de ayuda."],["New File","Nuevo Archivo"],["Open file","Abrir archivo"],["Save file","Guardar archivo"],["Save As","Guardar Como"],["Open debugger (F12)","Abrir depurador (F12)"],["Help","Ayuda"],["Edit current file pattern","Editar patrón de archivo actual"],["Add a new file pattern","Añadir un nuevo patrón de archivo"],["Remove current file pattern","Eliminar patrón de archivo actual"],["Rule's order does matter, especially when you use masking! Drag to reorder.","El orden de las reglas sí importa, ¡especialmente cuando usas máscaras! Arrastra para reordenar."]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"],["idx/1/innerText"],["idx/2/innerText"],["idx/3/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText"],["idx/5/innerText"],["idx/6/innerText"],["idx/7/innerText","idx/29/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText"],["idx/9/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText","idx/16/innerText","idx/28/innerText","idx/69/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText"],["idx/14/innerText"],["idx/15/innerText"],["idx/17/innerText"],["idx/18/innerText"],["idx/19/innerText"],["idx/20/innerText"],["idx/21/innerText"],["idx/22/innerText"],["idx/23/innerText"],["idx/24/innerText"],["idx/25/innerText"],["idx/26/innerText"],["idx/27/innerText"],["idx/30/innerText"],["idx/31/innerText"],["idx/32/innerText"],["idx/33/innerText"],["idx/34/innerText"],["idx/35/innerText"],["idx/36/innerText"],["idx/37/innerText"],["idx/38/innerText"],["idx/39/innerText"],["idx/40/innerText"],["idx/41/innerText"],["idx/42/innerText"],["idx/43/innerText"],["idx/44/innerText"],["idx/45/innerText"],["idx/46/innerText"],["idx/47/innerText"],["idx/48/innerText"],["idx/49/innerText"],["idx/50/innerText"],["idx/51/innerText"],["idx/52/innerText"],["idx/53/innerText"],["idx/54/innerText"],["idx/55/innerText"],["idx/56/innerText"],["idx/57/innerText"],["idx/58/innerText"],["idx/59/innerText"],["idx/60/innerText"],["idx/61/innerText"],["idx/62/innerText"],["idx/63/innerText"],["idx/64/innerText"],["idx/65/innerText"],["idx/66/innerText"],["idx/67/innerText"],["idx/68/innerText"],["idx/70/innerText"],["idx/71/innerText"],["idx/72/innerText"],["idx/73/innerText"],["idx/74/innerText"],["idx/0/attr/title"],["idx/1/attr/title"],["idx/2/attr/title"],["idx/3/attr/title"],["idx/4/attr/title"],["idx/5/attr/title"],["idx/6/attr/title"],["idx/7/attr/title"],["idx/8/attr/title"],["idx/9/attr/title"]],"basename":"modelEditor.html","dirname":"/addons/customParser/modelEditor","extension":".html","filename":"modelEditor.html","path":"/addons/customParser/modelEditor/modelEditor.html","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"<i class=\"icon-edit\"></i>":0,"<i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Add a new file group</label>":1,"Add a new file group":2,"<i class=\"icon-cancel-circled red\"></i><label data-tran=\"\">Remove current file group</label>":3,"Remove current file group":4,"Rules":5,"Hooks":6,"Options":7,"Testing":8,"Interpolate the strings before being displayed on the cells. <b>To Grid</b> is antithesis of <b>From Grid</b>":9,"Example":10,"For example, the text obtained from the parser is as follows:":11,"In this grid it will look like this:":12,"That's not the easiest text to work with.<br>\n  We can fix that by declaring <span class=\"inlineCode\">To Grid hooks</span> as follows:\n":13,"With the hook above the text in the grid will be :":14,"Interpolate the strings from the cells into the translation result. <b>From Grid</b> is antithesis of <b>To Grid</b>.":15,"\n  For example, the expected translated strings should be in JSON format.<br>\n  But writing translation in JSON format is not realy the easiest thing to do. <br>\n  So, instead of asking our translator to translate in JSON format, we can just ask them to type normally, and add a <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid hook</span> as follows:\n":16,"\n  With the <span class=\"inlineCode\">From Grid hook</span> above, the following translation ...\n":17,"...will be converted into desired format: ":18,"Edit the translated text just before writing it into a file.":19,"Parameters":20,"\n              <h3 data-tran=\"\">text</h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The text that is about to be written into a file.</p>\n            ":21,"text":22,"The text that is about to be written into a file.":23,"Return value":24,"\n              <h3><i>String</i></h3>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The text that will be written into a file.</p>\n            ":25,"The text that will be written into a file.":26,"General":27,"Read character encoding":28,"Force parser to use the following character encoding when reading the file(s).":29,"Write character encoding":30,"Force parser to use the following character encoding when writing the file(s).":31,"You are editing:":32,"Please select the mode of your pattern":33,"Regular expression Pattern":34,"A valid ECMA Script's regular expression along with the modifier.<br>You can use <a href=\"https://regex101.com/\" class=\"externalLink\" external=\"\">regex101.com</a> to create and test your pattern.":35,"Pay attention to the use of carriage return (\\r) in the text to be translated. regex101.com will strip out the carriage returns so your pattern may have a different effect than what you see on regex101. ":36,"<strong>About quantifier that captures a zero length string.</strong><br>\n            <i>Null</i> strings will cause problems for the parser. Therefore, instead of using the <strong>*</strong> quantifier which will also capture <i>nulls</i>, it is highly recommended to use the <strong>+</strong> quantifier which will only capture strings if exist.":37,"Translatable Capture groups":38,"Index of the regular expression's groups (Integer) for the translatable texts. Can be more than one. Separate with comma.":39,"Row Info Capture group":40,"\n            Index of the regular expression's group (Integer) for the row info (e.g. character name). <b>Only one group</b> is allowed. <br>\n            The value of the Row info can be carried over to the child rules and will be overwritten by the child rule's Row info value if exist.\n          ":41,"Context template":42,"\n            Context is unique identifier for translatable texts. <br>\n            You can use Javascript's template literals to add information to the context.<br>\n            <b>Available variable:</b>\n            <ul>\n              <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">GROUP[<i>n</i>]</span> - Group capture.</li>\n              <!-- <li><span class=\"inlineCode\">RULE_ID</span> - The ID of the rule.</li> -->\n            </ul>\n            <br>\n            <b>Example:</b>\n            <pre>item/${GROUP[2]}</pre>\n          ":43,"Action":44,"Capture value":45,"Capture then mask value":46,"Mask value":47,"Send to inner rule":48,"Edit inner rule <i class=\"icon-angle-double-right\"></i>":49,"What action the pattern is going to do.":50,"Javascript function":51,"Guide":52,"\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Arguments</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">The code you write will be inside a function with 2 arguments that can be accessed anywhere in your code:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li>\n              <h3>text</h3>\n              <p><b>String</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">A string of the entire content of the file.</p>\n            </li>\n            <li>\n              <h3>thisModel</h3>\n              <p><b>Object</b></p>\n              <p data-tran=\"\">The rule object that is currently used by the file.</p>\n            </li>\n          </ul>\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\"><i>this</i> Keyword</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\"><b>this</b> will reffer to the instance of CustomParser class.</p>\n\n        ":53,"Arguments":54,"The code you write will be inside a function with 2 arguments that can be accessed anywhere in your code:":55,"A string of the entire content of the file.":56,"The rule object that is currently used by the file.":57,"<i>this</i> Keyword":58,"<b>this</b> will reffer to the instance of CustomParser class.":59,"\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Expected Return Value</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">Your code must <b>return</b> one of the following value:</p>\n          <ul>\n            <li><pre>undefined</pre></li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", // Character name. optional\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // Context. optional\n  }\n</pre>\n            </li>\n            <li data-tran=\"\">Array of the offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"Another Character\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"Third Character\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            </li>\n          </ul>\n        ":60,"Expected Return Value":61,"Your code must <b>return</b> one of the following value:":62,"Offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  {\n    start:100,\n    end:120,\n    rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", // Character name. optional\n    context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"] // Context. optional\n  }\n</pre>\n            ":63,"Array of the offset of the captured text, for example:\n<pre>  [\n    {start:0, end:5, rowInfoText:\"Character Name\", context: [\"some\", \"context\", \"here\"]},\n    {start:12, end:30, rowInfoText:\"Another Character\", context: [\"another\", \"context\"]},\n    {start:4581, end:4593, rowInfoText:\"Third Character\", context: [\"third\", \"context\"]}\n  ]\n</pre>              \n            ":64,"\n          <h2 data-tran=\"\">Example</h2>\n          <p data-tran=\"\">The following code is an example to parse srt subtitle.</p>\n<pre><code class=\"language-javascript\">\n/*\n  Translator++ is using regexp-match-indices\n  by that all RegExp.exec() method will return their group offset\n  read more about Regular Expression Indices here: https://v8.dev/features/regexp-match-indices\n*/\n\nvar result \t\t\t= [];\nvar captureGroup \t= 1;\nvar regex \t\t\t= /\\d+[\\r\\n]+\\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+ --&gt; \\d+:\\d+:\\d+,\\d+[\\r\\n]+((.+\\r?\\n)+(?=(\\r?\\n)?))/g;\nwhile(null != (matches=regex.exec(text))) {\n  console.log(matches);\n  if (!matches?.indices?.[captureGroup]) continue;\n  result.push({\n    start\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][0],\n    end\t\t: matches.indices[captureGroup][1]\n  })\n}\nreturn result;             \n</code>\n</pre>\n        ":65,"The following code is an example to parse srt subtitle.":66,"Welcome to the Custom Parser Model Creator":67,"Please start by creating a new File Group.":68,"Please define what kind of file you want to parse by clicking\n      <button class=\"addFileGroup\" onclick=\"addFileGroup(this)\"><i class=\"icon-plus-circled\"></i>Add a new file group</button> button.\n    ":69,"Press F1 to open the help dialog.":70,"New File":71,"Open file":72,"Save file":73,"Save As":74,"Open debugger (F12)":75,"Help":76,"Edit current file pattern":77,"Add a new file pattern":78,"Remove current file pattern":79,"Rule's order does matter, especially when you use masking! Drag to reorder.":80},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/customParser/modelEditor/modelEditor.js":{"data":[["Do you want to close Model editor?\rAll unsaved changes will be discarded.","¿Quieres cerrar el Editor de Modelos?\rTodos los cambios no guardados se descartarán."],["Translate here using ","Traducir aquí usando "],["Do you want to discard your changes and open\n","¿Quieres descartar tus cambios y abrir\n"],["Error when trying to open file :","Error al intentar abrir el archivo:"],["Parser Model Creator","Creador de Modelos de Analizador"],["Please specify what kind of file you want to parse.\nYou can use semicolon separated glob pattens. For example: *.txt;*.js;*.json","Por favor, especifica qué tipo de archivo quieres analizar.\nPuedes usar patrones glob separados por punto y coma. Por ejemplo: *.txt;*.js;*.json"],["Failed to create new file group. Please check your pattern!","Error al crear nuevo grupo de archivos. ¡Por favor, verifica tu patrón!"],["Do you wish to remove current file group?\nYou can not undo this action!","¿Desea eliminar el grupo de archivos actual?\n¡No puede deshacer esta acción!"],["Do you want to discard your changes and create a new blank model?","¿Quiere descartar sus cambios y crear un nuevo modelo en blanco?"],["Do you want to discard your changes and open a file?","¿Quiere descartar sus cambios y abrir un archivo?"],["Clear history","Limpiar historial"],["Open latest file","Abrir archivo más reciente"],["Open from history","Abrir desde el historial"],["This feature only available if you are using Developer version of Translator++. You can switch into Developer version by using Basic Utilities -> Change Core NWJS.","Esta función solo está disponible si está usando la versión Desarrollador de Translator++. Puede cambiar a la versión Desarrollador usando Utilidades Básicas -> Cambiar Core NWJS."]],"context":[["tid/156/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5647/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9760/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10037/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10099/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10622/type/StringLiteral","tid/10941/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10665/type/StringLiteral","tid/10987/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11026/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11104/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11174/type/StringLiteral","tid/12080/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11459/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11525/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11607/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11750/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"modelEditor.js","dirname":"/addons/customParser/modelEditor","extension":".js","filename":"modelEditor.js","path":"/addons/customParser/modelEditor/modelEditor.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Do you want to close Model editor?\rAll unsaved changes will be discarded.":0,"Translate here using ":1,"Do you want to discard your changes and open\n":2,"Error when trying to open file :":3,"Parser Model Creator":4,"Please specify what kind of file you want to parse.\nYou can use semicolon separated glob pattens. For example: *.txt;*.js;*.json":5,"Failed to create new file group. Please check your pattern!":6,"Do you wish to remove current file group?\nYou can not undo this action!":7,"Do you want to discard your changes and create a new blank model?":8,"Do you want to discard your changes and open a file?":9,"Clear history":10,"Open latest file":11,"Open from history":12,"This feature only available if you are using Developer version of Translator++. You can switch into Developer version by using Basic Utilities -> Change Core NWJS.":13},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/googleCloudV3/trans.googleCloudV3.js":{"data":[["Invalid language string","Cadena de idioma inválida"],["Required field Project ID is blank!","¡El campo obligatorio ID del Proyecto está en blanco!"],["Required field Service Account Key is blank!","¡El campo obligatorio Clave de Cuenta de Servicio está en blanco!"],["Required field Server Location is blank!","¡El campo obligatorio Ubicación del Servidor está en blanco!"],["Required field Location of the glossary file is blank!","¡El campo obligatorio Ubicación del archivo del glosario está en blanco!"],["Required field Glossary Languages is blank!","¡El campo obligatorio Idiomas del Glosario está en blanco!"],["Invalid glossary language value","Valor de idioma del glosario inválido"],["Currently active glossary on this project: ","Glosario activo actualmente en este proyecto: "],["Error when retreiving glossary info: ","Error al recuperar la información del glosario: "],["Error when removing glossary : ","Error al eliminar el glosario: "],["Glossary removed successfully.","Glosario eliminado exitosamente."],["Error when creating glossary : ","Error al crear el glosario: "],["Glossary created successfully.","Glosario creado exitosamente."],["Configuration error:\r\n","Error de configuración:\r\n"],["No error found!","¡No se encontró ningún error!"],["Node JS is required to use Google Cloud Translate Advanced. Please download and install it from https://node.js","Se requiere Node JS para usar Google Cloud Translate Advanced. Por favor, descárgalo e instálalo desde https://node.js"]],"context":[["tid/2012/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3382/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3437/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3499/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3554/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3609/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3640/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3738/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3819/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3903/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3932/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4007/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4036/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4510/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4546/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6155/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"trans.googleCloudV3.js","dirname":"/addons/googleCloudV3","extension":".js","filename":"trans.googleCloudV3.js","path":"/addons/googleCloudV3/trans.googleCloudV3.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Invalid language string":0,"Required field Project ID is blank!":1,"Required field Service Account Key is blank!":2,"Required field Server Location is blank!":3,"Required field Location of the glossary file is blank!":4,"Required field Glossary Languages is blank!":5,"Invalid glossary language value":6,"Currently active glossary on this project: ":7,"Error when retreiving glossary info: ":8,"Error when removing glossary : ":9,"Glossary removed successfully.":10,"Error when creating glossary : ":11,"Glossary created successfully.":12,"Configuration error:\r\n":13,"No error found!":14,"Node JS is required to use Google Cloud Translate Advanced. Please download and install it from https://node.js":15},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/jcap/jcap.js":{"data":[["JCap executable not found at the specified location. Do you want to install JCap?","No se encontró el ejecutable de JCap en la ubicación especificada. ¿Quieres instalar JCap?"],["JCap agent started successfully. Press ","Agente JCap iniciado exitosamente. Presiona "],["jcapKey","jcapKey"],["Please set the JCap executable path in the addon settings.","Por favor, establece la ruta del ejecutable de JCap en la configuración del complemento."],["JCap executable already exists at the specified location.","El ejecutable de JCap ya existe en la ubicación especificada."],["JCap executable downloaded successfully.","Ejecutable de JCap descargado exitosamente."],["Failed to download JCap package. Please check the console for details.","Error al descargar el paquete de JCap. Por favor, revisa la consola para más detalles."],["JCap executable unpacked successfully.","Ejecutable de JCap descomprimido exitosamente."],["You can now start the JCap agent from the Main Menu - Tools - OCR Tools JCap - Start JCap Agent.","Ahora puedes iniciar el agente de JCap desde el Menú Principal - Herramientas - Herramientas OCR JCap - Iniciar Agente JCap."],["Start JCap OCR Agent","Iniciar Agente OCR JCap"],["Failed to unpack JCap package. Please check the console for details.","Error al descomprimir el paquete de JCap. Por favor, revisa la consola para más detalles."],["JCap executable not found at the specified location.","No se encontró el ejecutable de JCap en la ubicación especificada."],["Are you sure you want to uninstall JCap? This will delete the JCap executable and its configuration.","¿Estás seguro de que quieres desinstalar JCap? Esto eliminará el ejecutable de JCap y su configuración."],["JCap uninstalled successfully.","JCap desinstalado exitosamente."],["Failed to uninstall JCap. Please check the console for details.","Error al desinstalar JCap. Por favor, revisa la consola para más detalles."],["Help","Ayuda"],["JCap OCR is an OCR tool that allows you to capture text from the screen and translate it using JCap. To use it start the JCap by clicking the OCR button on main menu.\nThen press the configured key (default: F9) to capture text.","JCap OCR es una herramienta de OCR que te permite capturar texto de la pantalla y traducirlo usando JCap. Para usarlo, inicia JCap haciendo clic en el botón OCR en el menú principal.\nLuego presiona la tecla configurada (por defecto: F9) para capturar texto."]],"context":[["tid/736/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/854/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/862/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1005/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1038/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1392/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1442/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1554/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1566/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1591/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1647/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1732/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1755/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1828/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1861/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2350/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2371/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"jcap.js","dirname":"/addons/jcap","extension":".js","filename":"jcap.js","path":"/addons/jcap/jcap.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"JCap executable not found at the specified location. Do you want to install JCap?":0,"JCap agent started successfully. Press ":1,"jcapKey":2,"Please set the JCap executable path in the addon settings.":3,"JCap executable already exists at the specified location.":4,"JCap executable downloaded successfully.":5,"Failed to download JCap package. Please check the console for details.":6,"JCap executable unpacked successfully.":7,"You can now start the JCap agent from the Main Menu - Tools - OCR Tools JCap - Start JCap Agent.":8,"Start JCap OCR Agent":9,"Failed to unpack JCap package. Please check the console for details.":10,"JCap executable not found at the specified location.":11,"Are you sure you want to uninstall JCap? This will delete the JCap executable and its configuration.":12,"JCap uninstalled successfully.":13,"Failed to uninstall JCap. Please check the console for details.":14,"Help":15,"JCap OCR is an OCR tool that allows you to capture text from the screen and translate it using JCap. To use it start the JCap by clicking the OCR button on main menu.\nThen press the configured key (default: F9) to capture text.":16},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/jsonParser/json.js":{"data":[["Beautify JSON data","Embellecer datos JSON"],["When checked the generated data will be beautified.","Cuando esté marcado, los datos generados serán embellecidos."],["Start a new translation project from any JSON file.","Iniciar un nuevo proyecto de traducción desde cualquier archivo JSON."],["Translator++ will translate any translatable texts found in the JSON files.","Translator++ traducirá cualquier texto traducible encontrado en los archivos JSON."],["Read the guide on how to start a new JSON translation project here","Lee la guía sobre cómo iniciar un nuevo proyecto de traducción JSON aquí"],["Translator++ will scan through this folder for any JSON files.","Translator++ escaneará esta carpeta en busca de archivos JSON."],["How do you want to get the data from the JSON object?","¿Cómo quieres obtener los datos del objeto JSON?"],["Parser mode","Modo de análisis"],["<h2>Simple Mode</h2><p>In simple mode, you can translate all strings value recursively inside the JSON object.<br />In simple mode, the original texts is always the value.</p>","<h2>Modo Simple</h2><p>En modo simple, puedes traducir todos los valores de cadena recursivamente dentro del objeto JSON.<br />En modo simple, los textos originales siempre son el valor.</p>"],["<h2>Advanced Mode</h2><p>In advanced mode you can query the JSON and handle key-value paired type translation table where the original text is the key.</p>","<h2>Modo Avanzado</h2><p>En modo avanzado, puedes consultar el JSON y manejar tablas de traducción de tipo clave-valor donde el texto original es la clave.</p>"],["<h2>Info</h2><p>You can use the following query field to select a specific part of the JSON object. The result of the query must be an object or an array of texts.</p>","<h2>Información</h2><p>Puedes usar el siguiente campo de consulta para seleccionar una parte específica del objeto JSON. El resultado de la consulta debe ser un objeto o un array de textos.</p>"],["<h3>For objects</h3><p>The <b>key will be used as the original text</b> and <b>the value as the default translation</b>.</p>","<h3>Para objetos</h3><p>La <b>clave se usará como el texto original</b> y <b>el valor como la traducción predeterminada</b>.</p>"],["Parser will automatically register if the value is a string, null, or undefined.<br />","El analizador registrará automáticamente si el valor es una cadena, nulo o indefinido.<br />"],["<h3>For arrays</h3><p>The parser will register all string values in the array as translatable texts.</p>","<h3>Para arrays</h3><p>El analizador registrará todos los valores de cadena en el array como textos traducibles.</p>"],["Start project","Iniciar proyecto"],["`Invalid destination directory:\\n${","`Directorio de destino inválido:\\n${"],["}`","}`"]],"context":[["tid/92/type/StringLiteral","tid/119/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/102/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2826/type/StringLiteral","tid/2879/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2831/type/StringLiteral","tid/2884/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2836/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2998/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3038/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3214/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3293/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3346/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3446/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3451/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3456/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3461/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3615/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4070/type/TemplateHead"],["tid/4072/type/TemplateTail"]],"basename":"json.js","dirname":"/addons/jsonParser","extension":".js","filename":"json.js","path":"/addons/jsonParser/json.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Beautify JSON data":0,"When checked the generated data will be beautified.":1,"Start a new translation project from any JSON file.":2,"Translator++ will translate any translatable texts found in the JSON files.":3,"Read the guide on how to start a new JSON translation project here":4,"Translator++ will scan through this folder for any JSON files.":5,"How do you want to get the data from the JSON object?":6,"Parser mode":7,"<h2>Simple Mode</h2><p>In simple mode, you can translate all strings value recursively inside the JSON object.<br />In simple mode, the original texts is always the value.</p>":8,"<h2>Advanced Mode</h2><p>In advanced mode you can query the JSON and handle key-value paired type translation table where the original text is the key.</p>":9,"<h2>Info</h2><p>You can use the following query field to select a specific part of the JSON object. The result of the query must be an object or an array of texts.</p>":10,"<h3>For objects</h3><p>The <b>key will be used as the original text</b> and <b>the value as the default translation</b>.</p>":11,"Parser will automatically register if the value is a string, null, or undefined.<br />":12,"<h3>For arrays</h3><p>The parser will register all string values in the array as translatable texts.</p>":13,"Start project":14,"`Invalid destination directory:\\n${":15,"}`":16},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/kagParser/TyranoParser.js":{"data":[["label","etiqueta"],["is duplicated in the same scenario file","está duplicada en el mismo archivo de escenario"]],"context":[["tid/2372/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2390/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"TyranoParser.js","dirname":"/addons/kagParser","extension":".js","filename":"TyranoParser.js","path":"/addons/kagParser/TyranoParser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"label":0,"is duplicated in the same scenario file":1},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/kagParser/kagParser.js":{"data":[["Select directory","Seleccionar directorio"],["Select a directory to repack","Selecciona un directorio para reempaquetar"],["Target xp3","XP3 objetivo"],["Select filename. Special filename such as <b>patch.xp3</b>, <b>patch2.xp3</b>...etc get priority over data.xp3 when loaded.","Selecciona el nombre del archivo. Nombres especiales como <b>patch.xp3</b>, <b>patch2.xp3</b>... etc. tienen prioridad sobre data.xp3 al cargarse."],["Patch to allow folder structure","Parche para permitir estructura de carpetas"],["By default KAG engine do not read files inside a folder within xp3 files. This option will automatically add folder structure definition to Config.tjs. Has no effect if no Config.tjs file is found.","Por defecto, el motor KAG no lee archivos dentro de una carpeta en archivos xp3. Esta opción agregará automáticamente la definición de estructura de carpetas a Config.tjs. No tiene efecto si no se encuentra el archivo Config.tjs."],["Repack into xp3","Reempaquetar en xp3"],["Close","Cerrar"],["Process","Procesar"],["<b>Order does matter</b> if you unpack multiple files at once! The files will be unpacked in ordered manner. If the files exist it will be overwritten.","<b>El orden importa</b> si descomprimes múltiples archivos a la vez. Los archivos se descomprimirán en orden. Si los archivos existen, se sobrescribirán."],["Unpack XP3 files","Descomprimir archivos XP3"],["Repack a folder to xp3","Reempaquetar una carpeta a xp3"],["Unpack xp3 file","Descomprimir archivo xp3"],["Before you create a new project, please make sure that :","Antes de crear un nuevo proyecto, asegúrate de que:"],["All .ks & .tjs files are in plain text (uncompiled, unscrambled, and unencrypted)","Todos los archivos .ks y .tjs estén en texto plano (sin compilar, sin ofuscar y sin encriptar)"],["KAG Games should be playable even without being repacked. So you should check whether your game is playable or not after being extracted.","Los juegos KAG deben ser jugables incluso sin reempaquetar. Así que debes verificar si tu juego es jugable después de extraerlo."],["Some of the actions will modify your game. <b>So make sure to create a backup of your game!</b>","Algunas acciones modificarán tu juego. <b>¡Así que asegúrate de crear una copia de seguridad de tu juego!</b>"],["Select the game executable file. This file is the main game file that will be used to extract the game data.","Selecciona el archivo ejecutable del juego. Este archivo es el principal que se usará para extraer los datos del juego."],["Translator++ can extract XP3 files with AEC addon. <b>But the extractor is not a surefire solution for all kind XP3</b>.","Translator++ puede extraer archivos XP3 con el complemento AEC. <b>Pero el extractor no es una solución infalible para todo tipo de XP3</b>."],["Some scenario files are encrypted. Check this option if you wish Translator++ to try to decrypt them.","Algunos archivos de escenario están encriptados. Marca esta opción si quieres que Translator++ intente desencriptarlos."],["This may not work on some projects.","Esto puede no funcionar en algunos proyectos."],["List of the possible character encodings. <b>Order does matter!</b>. You can drag to sort the list.","Lista de las posibles codificaciones de caracteres. <b>¡El orden sí importa!</b>. Puedes arrastrar para ordenar la lista."],["Literal tags are the tags that will be escaped into Translator++ editor.","Las etiquetas literales son las que se escaparán en el editor de Translator++."],["<b>ruby l r</b> are mandatory.","<b>ruby l r</b> son obligatorios."],["<b>[r]</b> Tags will be interpolated by Translator++ into a new line. So you don't need to write <b>[r]</b> explicitly.","Las etiquetas <b>[r]</b> serán interpoladas por Translator++ en una nueva línea. Así que no necesitas escribir <b>[r]</b> explícitamente."],["Kirikiri script (.ks) is heavily customizable and allows developers to create their own tags.","El script Kirikiri (.ks) es altamente personalizable y permite a los desarrolladores crear sus propias etiquetas."],["Translator++ can handle standard tags such as character names that start with a sharp (#).","Translator++ puede manejar etiquetas estándar como los nombres de personajes que comienzan con un numeral (#)."],["However, Translator++ cannot handle custom tags created by developers.","Sin embargo, Translator++ no puede manejar etiquetas personalizadas creadas por los desarrolladores."],["Therefore, you may need to define the tags and attributes that need to be translated and those that need to be marked as actor names.","Por lo tanto, es posible que necesites definir las etiquetas y atributos que requieren traducción y aquellos que deben marcarse como nombres de actores."],["You might need to <input type=\"button\" value=\"extract your xp3 game\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.kagParser.utils.unpackXP3Dialog()\" /> and analyze the ks script inside it before starting the project.","Podrías necesitar <input type=\"button\" value=\"extraer tu juego xp3\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.kagParser.utils.unpackXP3Dialog()\" /> y analizar el script ks dentro de él antes de comenzar el proyecto."],["Create Project","Crear Proyecto"],["Pack a folder into xp3","Empaquetar una carpeta en xp3"],["Select the target character encoding.<br />Most Japanese KAG games are written with SHIFT-JIS, but KAG actually has support for UTF16LE unicode. Many translators set the character encoding to UTF16LE so that the game is playable non-Japanese windows without locale emulator. And most importantly, can displays characters outside SHIFT-JIS such as \"café\".<br />By default Translator++ will write to its original character encoding.","Selecciona la codificación de caracteres objetivo.<br />La mayoría de los juegos KAG japoneses están escritos con SHIFT-JIS, pero KAG en realidad tiene soporte para unicode UTF16LE. Muchos traductores establecen la codificación de caracteres en UTF16LE para que el juego sea jugable en Windows no japonés sin emulador de localización. Y lo más importante, puede mostrar caracteres fuera de SHIFT-JIS como \"café\".<br />Por defecto, Translator++ escribirá en su codificación de caracteres original."],["There are several ways to produce playable localized game for KAG. Please select one that suit your preference.","Existen varias formas de producir un juego localizado jugable para KAG. Por favor, selecciona la que se adapte a tu preferencia."]],"context":[["tid/2913/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2918/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2925/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2930/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2937/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2942/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3173/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3274/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3325/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3558/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3684/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3872/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3929/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4297/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4302/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4307/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4312/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4468/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4508/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4542/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4549/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4583/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4631/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4640/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4649/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5046/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5053/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5060/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5067/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5078/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5389/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6942/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7218/type/StringLiteral","tid/7397/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7462/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"kagParser.js","dirname":"/addons/kagParser","extension":".js","filename":"kagParser.js","path":"/addons/kagParser/kagParser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Select directory":0,"Select a directory to repack":1,"Target xp3":2,"Select filename. Special filename such as <b>patch.xp3</b>, <b>patch2.xp3</b>...etc get priority over data.xp3 when loaded.":3,"Patch to allow folder structure":4,"By default KAG engine do not read files inside a folder within xp3 files. This option will automatically add folder structure definition to Config.tjs. Has no effect if no Config.tjs file is found.":5,"Repack into xp3":6,"Close":7,"Process":8,"<b>Order does matter</b> if you unpack multiple files at once! The files will be unpacked in ordered manner. If the files exist it will be overwritten.":9,"Unpack XP3 files":10,"Repack a folder to xp3":11,"Unpack xp3 file":12,"Before you create a new project, please make sure that :":13,"All .ks & .tjs files are in plain text (uncompiled, unscrambled, and unencrypted)":14,"KAG Games should be playable even without being repacked. So you should check whether your game is playable or not after being extracted.":15,"Some of the actions will modify your game. <b>So make sure to create a backup of your game!</b>":16,"Select the game executable file. This file is the main game file that will be used to extract the game data.":17,"Translator++ can extract XP3 files with AEC addon. <b>But the extractor is not a surefire solution for all kind XP3</b>.":18,"Some scenario files are encrypted. Check this option if you wish Translator++ to try to decrypt them.":19,"This may not work on some projects.":20,"List of the possible character encodings. <b>Order does matter!</b>. You can drag to sort the list.":21,"Literal tags are the tags that will be escaped into Translator++ editor.":22,"<b>ruby l r</b> are mandatory.":23,"<b>[r]</b> Tags will be interpolated by Translator++ into a new line. So you don't need to write <b>[r]</b> explicitly.":24,"Kirikiri script (.ks) is heavily customizable and allows developers to create their own tags.":25,"Translator++ can handle standard tags such as character names that start with a sharp (#).":26,"However, Translator++ cannot handle custom tags created by developers.":27,"Therefore, you may need to define the tags and attributes that need to be translated and those that need to be marked as actor names.":28,"You might need to <input type=\"button\" value=\"extract your xp3 game\" onclick=\"addonLoader.addons.kagParser.utils.unpackXP3Dialog()\" /> and analyze the ks script inside it before starting the project.":29,"Create Project":30,"Pack a folder into xp3":31,"Select the target character encoding.<br />Most Japanese KAG games are written with SHIFT-JIS, but KAG actually has support for UTF16LE unicode. Many translators set the character encoding to UTF16LE so that the game is playable non-Japanese windows without locale emulator. And most importantly, can displays characters outside SHIFT-JIS such as \"café\".<br />By default Translator++ will write to its original character encoding.":32,"There are several ways to produce playable localized game for KAG. Please select one that suit your preference.":33},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/po/ExportImport.js":{"data":[["Select mode","Seleccionar modo"],["Select how do you want to start your project. By selecting files or folders.","Selecciona cómo quieres comenzar tu proyecto. Seleccionando archivos o carpetas."],["Select Folder","Seleccionar Carpeta"],["Select the folder for processing. Translator++ will recursively retrieve the PO files from the specified folder.","Selecciona la carpeta para procesar. Translator++ recuperará recursivamente los archivos PO de la carpeta especificada."],["Select File","Seleccionar Archivo"],["Select the files you want to process.","Selecciona los archivos que quieres procesar."],["Filters","Filtros"],["Filter the file name with glob pattern. Default is <code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>","Filtra el nombre del archivo con patrón glob. Por defecto es <code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>"],["All .po files in the selected folder and its subfolders.","Todos los archivos .po en la carpeta seleccionada y sus subcarpetas."],["All .mo files in the selected folder and its subfolders.","Todos los archivos .mo en la carpeta seleccionada y sus subcarpetas."],["PO Files","Archivos PO"],["MO Files","Archivos MO"],["You are about to export the translations as MO files.\n","Estás a punto de exportar las traducciones como archivos MO.\n"],["- MO files are binary files that cannot be edited manually.\n","- Los archivos MO son archivos binarios que no se pueden editar manualmente.\n"],["- Only translated entries are stored in MO files.\n","- Solo las entradas traducidas se almacenan en archivos MO.\n"],["Are you sure you want to proceed?","¿Estás seguro de que quieres proceder?"],["PO / MO Files","Archivos PO / MO"]],"context":[["tid/1174/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1196/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1223/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1233/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1267/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1277/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1317/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1327/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1335/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1340/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2342/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2509/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2534/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2542/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2550/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2558/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2747/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"ExportImport.js","dirname":"/addons/po","extension":".js","filename":"ExportImport.js","path":"/addons/po/ExportImport.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Select mode":0,"Select how do you want to start your project. By selecting files or folders.":1,"Select Folder":2,"Select the folder for processing. Translator++ will recursively retrieve the PO files from the specified folder.":3,"Select File":4,"Select the files you want to process.":5,"Filters":6,"Filter the file name with glob pattern. Default is <code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>":7,"All .po files in the selected folder and its subfolders.":8,"All .mo files in the selected folder and its subfolders.":9,"PO Files":10,"MO Files":11,"You are about to export the translations as MO files.\n":12,"- MO files are binary files that cannot be edited manually.\n":13,"- Only translated entries are stored in MO files.\n":14,"Are you sure you want to proceed?":15,"PO / MO Files":16},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/po/PoParser.js":{"data":[[".po and .mo files are standard text-based and binary file formats used together for software localization, particularly in WordPress, to translate themes and plugins. The PO (Portable Object) file is human-readable text containing translations, while the MO (Machine Object) file is a compiled, machine-readable binary file used by software for faster loading.","Los archivos .po y .mo son formatos de archivo estándar, basados en texto y binario, utilizados juntos para la localización de software, particularmente en WordPress, para traducir temas y plugins. El archivo PO (Objeto Portátil) es texto legible por humanos que contiene traducciones, mientras que el archivo MO (Objeto Máquina) es un archivo binario compilado y legible por máquina utilizado por el software para una carga más rápida."],["Start translation from PO (Portable Object) and MO (Machine Object) translation scripts","Iniciar traducción desde scripts de traducción PO (Objeto Portátil) y MO (Objeto Máquina)"],["Create Project","Crear Proyecto"],["Select mode","Seleccionar modo"],["Select how do you want to start your project. By selecting files or folders.","Selecciona cómo quieres iniciar tu proyecto. Seleccionando archivos o carpetas."],["Select Folder","Seleccionar Carpeta"],["Select the folder for processing. Translator++ will recursively retrieve the PO files from the specified folder.","Selecciona la carpeta para procesar. Translator++ recuperará recursivamente los archivos PO de la carpeta especificada."],["Select File","Seleccionar Archivo"],["Select the files you want to process.","Selecciona los archivos que quieres procesar."],["Filters","Filtros"],["Filter the file name with glob pattern. Default is <code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>","Filtra el nombre del archivo con patrón glob. Por defecto es <code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>"],["All .po files in the selected folder and its subfolders.","Todos los archivos .po en la carpeta seleccionada y sus subcarpetas."],["All .mo files in the selected folder and its subfolders.","Todos los archivos .mo en la carpeta seleccionada y sus subcarpetas."],["ProjectTitle","Título del Proyecto"],["Your project title","Tu título de proyecto"]],"context":[["tid/907/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/951/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1028/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1488/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1510/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1537/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1547/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1580/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1590/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1623/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1633/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1641/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1646/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1681/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1691/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"PoParser.js","dirname":"/addons/po","extension":".js","filename":"PoParser.js","path":"/addons/po/PoParser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{".po and .mo files are standard text-based and binary file formats used together for software localization, particularly in WordPress, to translate themes and plugins. The PO (Portable Object) file is human-readable text containing translations, while the MO (Machine Object) file is a compiled, machine-readable binary file used by software for faster loading.":0,"Start translation from PO (Portable Object) and MO (Machine Object) translation scripts":1,"Create Project":2,"Select mode":3,"Select how do you want to start your project. By selecting files or folders.":4,"Select Folder":5,"Select the folder for processing. Translator++ will recursively retrieve the PO files from the specified folder.":6,"Select File":7,"Select the files you want to process.":8,"Filters":9,"Filter the file name with glob pattern. Default is <code>**/*.{po,mo}</code>":10,"All .po files in the selected folder and its subfolders.":11,"All .mo files in the selected folder and its subfolders.":12,"ProjectTitle":13,"Your project title":14},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/pylivemakerParser/plmUtils.js":{"data":[["Livemaker Game Extractor","Extractor de Juegos Livemaker"],["Half width character patch","Parche de caracteres de ancho medio"],["Patch half-width character","Parchear caracteres de ancho medio"]],"context":[["tid/347/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/809/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate","tid/870/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1061/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"plmUtils.js","dirname":"/addons/pylivemakerParser","extension":".js","filename":"plmUtils.js","path":"/addons/pylivemakerParser/plmUtils.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Livemaker Game Extractor":0,"Half width character patch":1,"Patch half-width character":2},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/pylivemakerParser/pylivemakerparser.js":{"data":[["Livemaker engine has limitations regarding language support. It requires setting the Windows non-unicode system locale to Japanese to run LiveMaker and LiveNovel applications. Additionally, the engine is hardcoded to only use installed Windows system fonts that support Windows Shift-JIS (MS CP932), which means it may not supports other locales or encodings","El motor Livemaker tiene limitaciones respecto al soporte de idiomas. Requiere configurar la configuración regional del sistema Windows no Unicode a japonés para ejecutar aplicaciones LiveMaker y LiveNovel. Además, el motor está codificado para usar solo fuentes del sistema Windows instaladas que admitan Windows Shift-JIS (MS CP932), lo que significa que puede no admitir otras configuraciones regionales o codificaciones."],["Next","Siguiente"],["Unable to detect RPG Maker type!\nAre you sure the game is RPG Maker XP, VX or VX Ace?","¡No se puede detectar el tipo de RPG Maker!\n¿Estás seguro de que el juego es RPG Maker XP, VX o VX Ace?"],["Create a new project","Crear un nuevo proyecto"],["Invalid destination file:","Archivo de destino inválido:"],[" doesn't seems to be a LiveMaker game."," no parece ser un juego de LiveMaker."]],"context":[["tid/5574/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/5684/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6243/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6541/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6626/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/6662/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"pylivemakerparser.js","dirname":"/addons/pylivemakerParser","extension":".js","filename":"pylivemakerparser.js","path":"/addons/pylivemakerParser/pylivemakerparser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Livemaker engine has limitations regarding language support. It requires setting the Windows non-unicode system locale to Japanese to run LiveMaker and LiveNovel applications. Additionally, the engine is hardcoded to only use installed Windows system fonts that support Windows Shift-JIS (MS CP932), which means it may not supports other locales or encodings":0,"Next":1,"Unable to detect RPG Maker type!\nAre you sure the game is RPG Maker XP, VX or VX Ace?":2,"Create a new project":3,"Invalid destination file:":4," doesn't seems to be a LiveMaker game.":5},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/renParser/renParser.js":{"data":[["Dev path is not defined.\nYou should inject your game once to generate dev path.","La ruta de desarrollo no está definida.\nDeberías inyectar tu juego una vez para generar la ruta de desarrollo."],["Decompile all rpyc files","Descompilar todos los archivos rpyc"],["Attempt to decompile all rpyc files into .rpy.<br />Translator++ has its own decompiler. But it is reported that sometimes it fails to decompile some of the games created with Renpy 7. You can leave this field unchecked and decompile the game yourself with your own tools before starting a project.","Intenta descompilar todos los archivos rpyc en .rpy.<br />Translator++ tiene su propio descompilador. Pero se reporta que a veces falla al descompilar algunos juegos creados con Renpy 7. Puedes dejar este campo desmarcado y descompilar el juego tú mismo con tus propias herramientas antes de iniciar un proyecto."],["Overwrite rpy","Sobrescribir rpy"],["If checked then the decompiler <b>will overwrite the existing uncompiled rpy files</b>.","Si está marcado, el descompilador <b>sobrescribirá los archivos rpy descompilados existentes</b>."],["Exclude command","Excluir comando"],["This option will allow us to skip some command for being processed and translated","Esta opción nos permitirá omitir algunos comandos para que no sean procesados ni traducidos"],["Separate entries with a space","Separa las entradas con un espacio"],["For example, if you put <b>old</b> then all lines in rpy that started with <b>old</b> will be ignored","Por ejemplo, si pones <b>old</b>, entonces todas las líneas en rpy que comiencen con <b>old</b> serán ignoradas"],["Are you sure want to start a project without decompiling the rpyc files?","¿Estás seguro de que quieres iniciar un proyecto sin descompilar los archivos rpyc?"],["The file you're selected is not a Ren'Py game executable file.\nDo you want to continue anyway?","El archivo que seleccionaste no es un archivo ejecutable de juego Ren'Py.\n¿Quieres continuar de todos modos?"],["Play last build","Reproducir la última compilación"],["Open Ren'Py documentation","Abrir la documentación de Ren'Py"],["The option has been set to use the legacy parser.\nYou can switch back to the new parser anytime via option menu.","La opción se ha configurado para usar el analizador heredado.\nPuedes volver al nuevo analizador en cualquier momento desde el menú de opciones."]],"context":[["tid/6255/type/StringLiteral","tid/11918/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10916/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10921/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10926/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10931/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10936/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10941/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10946/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/10951/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11291/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11456/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11869/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/11970/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/12146/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"renParser.js","dirname":"/addons/renParser","extension":".js","filename":"renParser.js","path":"/addons/renParser/renParser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Dev path is not defined.\nYou should inject your game once to generate dev path.":0,"Decompile all rpyc files":1,"Attempt to decompile all rpyc files into .rpy.<br />Translator++ has its own decompiler. But it is reported that sometimes it fails to decompile some of the games created with Renpy 7. You can leave this field unchecked and decompile the game yourself with your own tools before starting a project.":2,"Overwrite rpy":3,"If checked then the decompiler <b>will overwrite the existing uncompiled rpy files</b>.":4,"Exclude command":5,"This option will allow us to skip some command for being processed and translated":6,"Separate entries with a space":7,"For example, if you put <b>old</b> then all lines in rpy that started with <b>old</b> will be ignored":8,"Are you sure want to start a project without decompiling the rpyc files?":9,"The file you're selected is not a Ren'Py game executable file.\nDo you want to continue anyway?":10,"Play last build":11,"Open Ren'Py documentation":12,"The option has been set to use the legacy parser.\nYou can switch back to the new parser anytime via option menu.":13},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/resourceParser/ResourceParser.js":{"data":[["Windows binary file translator","Traductor de archivos binarios de Windows"],["Parsing Windows binary file with","Analizando archivo binario de Windows con"],["Sellect supported files","Seleccionar archivos compatibles"],["Select supported file type to translate.","Selecciona el tipo de archivo compatible para traducir."],["Create a new project","Crear un nuevo proyecto"],["Please select a supported file to parse","Por favor, selecciona un archivo compatible para analizar"],["Please enter your project title!","¡Por favor, ingresa el título de tu proyecto!"]],"context":[["tid/4109/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4114/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4127/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4132/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4469/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4550/type/StringLiteral","tid/4600/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4661/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"ResourceParser.js","dirname":"/addons/resourceParser","extension":".js","filename":"ResourceParser.js","path":"/addons/resourceParser/ResourceParser.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Windows binary file translator":0,"Parsing Windows binary file with":1,"Sellect supported files":2,"Select supported file type to translate.":3,"Create a new project":4,"Please select a supported file to parse":5,"Please enter your project title!":6},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rm2k2k3/2k.js":{"data":[["Use Native RPG Player","Usar Reproductor RPG Nativo"],["Use native RPG Player instead of Easy RPG Player","Usa el Reproductor RPG Nativo en lugar del Reproductor RPG Fácil"],["Use native RPG Player","Usar Reproductor RPG Nativo"],["Target folder","Carpeta de destino"],["Select destination folder.","Selecciona la carpeta de destino."],["Install Easy RPG Player","Instalar Easy RPG Player"],["Close","Cerrar"],["Install","Instalar"],["Process completed!","¡Proceso completado!"],["RPG Maker 2000 & 2003 Parser with xmlTrans plugin.","Analizador de RPG Maker 2000 y 2003 con el plugin xmlTrans."],["Play last build","Jugar la última compilación"],["Apply translation then play","Aplicar traducción y luego jugar"],["Setup Easy RPG in the current directory","Configurar Easy RPG en el directorio actual"]],"context":[["tid/164/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/174/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/184/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5955/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/5960/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6034/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6151/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6202/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6393/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/7198/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/8288/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8344/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8395/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"2k.js","dirname":"/addons/rm2k2k3","extension":".js","filename":"2k.js","path":"/addons/rm2k2k3/2k.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Use Native RPG Player":0,"Use native RPG Player instead of Easy RPG Player":1,"Use native RPG Player":2,"Target folder":3,"Select destination folder.":4,"Install Easy RPG Player":5,"Close":6,"Install":7,"Process completed!":8,"RPG Maker 2000 & 2003 Parser with xmlTrans plugin.":9,"Play last build":10,"Apply translation then play":11,"Setup Easy RPG in the current directory":12},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rm2k2k3/2knew.js":{"data":[["Start translation from RM2k / RM2k3 engine","Iniciar traducción desde el motor RM2k / RM2k3"],["Create project","Crear proyecto"],["Please select RPG Maker 2000/2003 game!","¡Por favor selecciona un juego de RPG Maker 2000/2003!"],["Unable to detect RPG Maker type!\nAre you sure the game is RPG Maker 2000 / 2003?","¡No se pudo detectar el tipo de RPG Maker!\n¿Estás seguro de que el juego es RPG Maker 2000 / 2003?"]],"context":[["tid/3902/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3971/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4041/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4450/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"2knew.js","dirname":"/addons/rm2k2k3","extension":".js","filename":"2knew.js","path":"/addons/rm2k2k3/2knew.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Start translation from RM2k / RM2k3 engine":0,"Create project":1,"Please select RPG Maker 2000/2003 game!":2,"Unable to detect RPG Maker type!\nAre you sure the game is RPG Maker 2000 / 2003?":3},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rm2k2k3/utils.js":{"data":[["Target folder","Carpeta de destino"],["Select destination folder.","Seleccionar carpeta de destino."],["Install Easy RPG Player","Instalar Easy RPG Player"],["Close","Cerrar"],["Install","Instalar"],["How to add a custom font.\n\nThe fonts must be placed in the Font folder of the game directory and must be named Font.ttf or Font2.ttf. Which font file is used depends on the system graphic font setting. Besides ttf, fon and many other fonts are supported (anything supported by FreeType, the best open source library available for font rendering).\n\nSource: https://blog.easyrpg.org/2023/04/easyrpg-player-0-8-paralyze/","Cómo agregar una fuente personalizada.\n\nLas fuentes deben colocarse en la carpeta Font del directorio del juego y deben llamarse Font.ttf o Font2.ttf. Qué archivo de fuente se usa depende de la configuración de fuente gráfica del sistema. Además de ttf, se admiten fon y muchas otras fuentes (cualquier cosa compatible con FreeType, la mejor biblioteca de código abierto disponible para renderizado de fuentes).\n\nFuente: https://blog.easyrpg.org/2023/04/easyrpg-player-0-8-paralyze/"],["Process completed!","¡Proceso completado!"],["Play last build","Jugar la última compilación"],["Apply translation then play","Aplicar traducción y luego jugar"],["Setup Easy RPG in the current directory","Configurar Easy RPG en el directorio actual"]],"context":[["tid/934/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/939/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1013/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1130/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1181/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1402/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/1450/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1685/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1743/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1796/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"utils.js","dirname":"/addons/rm2k2k3","extension":".js","filename":"utils.js","path":"/addons/rm2k2k3/utils.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Target folder":0,"Select destination folder.":1,"Install Easy RPG Player":2,"Close":3,"Install":4,"How to add a custom font.\n\nThe fonts must be placed in the Font folder of the game directory and must be named Font.ttf or Font2.ttf. Which font file is used depends on the system graphic font setting. Besides ttf, fon and many other fonts are supported (anything supported by FreeType, the best open source library available for font rendering).\n\nSource: https://blog.easyrpg.org/2023/04/easyrpg-player-0-8-paralyze/":5,"Process completed!":6,"Play last build":7,"Apply translation then play":8,"Setup Easy RPG in the current directory":9},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rmmv/rmmv.js":{"data":[["Beautify JSON data","Embellecer datos JSON"],["When checked the generated data will be beautified.","Cuando esté marcado, los datos generados serán embellecidos."],["Error loading system.json","Error cargando system.json"],["Loading","Cargando"],["index.html not found in","index.html no encontrado en"],["Encrypted game","Juego encriptado"],["Select the index.html of your encrypted game.","Selecciona el index.html de tu juego encriptado."],["Target folder","Carpeta destino"],["Select destination folder. The process will replace the existing files.","Selecciona la carpeta de destino. El proceso reemplazará los archivos existentes."],["Decrypt Resources","Descifrar recursos"],["Close","Cerrar"],["Process","Procesar"],["Source path can not empty","La ruta de origen no puede estar vacía"],["Destination path can not empty","La ruta de destino no puede estar vacía"],["Path is not a file:","La ruta no es un archivo:"],["Invalid directory:","Directorio inválido:"],["Extract enigma","Extraer enigma"],["Select enigma file.","Selecciona el archivo enigma."],["Extract Enigma","Extraer Enigma"],["Selected file is not an Enigma Virtual Box package.","El archivo seleccionado no es un paquete de Enigma Virtual Box."],["Plugins are already fetched for this project. Want to re-fetch the plugins?","Los complementos ya se han obtenido para este proyecto. ¿Quieres volver a obtener los complementos?"],["Translate Javascript File?","¿Traducir archivo Javascript?"],["Cancel","Cancelar"],["I know the risk, Proceed!","Conozco el riesgo, ¡proceder!"],["Game Executable Path","Ruta del ejecutable del juego"],["Path to the game executable file (.exe)","Ruta al archivo ejecutable del juego (.exe)"],["NWJS Version","Versión de NWJS"],["Change into this NWJS version","Cambiar a esta versión de NWJS"],["Use Developer version","Usar versión de desarrollador"],["Use the NWJS Developer version. The Developer version has developer tools available. Suitable for debugging and development.","Usar la versión de desarrollador de NWJS. La versión de desarrollador tiene herramientas de desarrollo disponibles. Adecuada para depuración y desarrollo."],["In Developer version you can use <b>Developer Console</b>. Developer Console can be accessed by pressing F12 or right-clicking the app and selecting 'Inspect'.","En la versión de desarrollador puedes usar la <b>Consola de desarrollador</b>. La Consola de desarrollador se puede acceder presionando F12 o haciendo clic derecho en la aplicación y seleccionando 'Inspeccionar'."],["Use 32-bit version","Usar versión de 32 bits"],["Use the 32-bit version of NWJS. The 32-bit version is useful for compatibility with older systems. It is recommended to uncheck this option if possible (just upgrade your machine, dude).","Usar la versión de 32 bits de NWJS. La versión de 32 bits es útil para compatibilidad con sistemas antiguos. Se recomienda desmarcar esta opción si es posible (solo actualiza tu máquina, amigo)."],["Some game feature may not work across NWJS version","Algunas funciones del juego pueden no funcionar entre versiones de NWJS"],["Please be aware that some game feature may not work across NWJS version.","Por favor, ten en cuenta que algunas funciones del juego pueden no funcionar entre versiones de NWJS."],["Change RPG Maker MV / RPG Maker MZ / NWJS version","Cambiar versión de RPG Maker MV / RPG Maker MZ / NWJS"],["This operation will change the NW.js version into","Esta operación cambiará la versión de NW.js a"],["Please close the application first before continuing.\nDo you want to continue?","Por favor, cierra la aplicación primero antes de continuar.\n¿Quieres continuar?"],["The selected file is not a valid NW.js application.","El archivo seleccionado no es una aplicación válida de NW.js."],["Could not find index.html in the game directory.","No se pudo encontrar index.html en el directorio del juego."],["Debug menu script not found in addon directory.","Script del menú de depuración no encontrado en el directorio de complementos."],["Debug menu script is already installed in index.html.","El script del menú de depuración ya está instalado en index.html."],["Debug options installed successfully!","¡Opciones de depuración instaladas exitosamente!"],["The selected game is not running in NW.js Developer Mode (SDK).\n\n","El juego seleccionado no se está ejecutando en el Modo Desarrollador de NW.js (SDK).\n\n"],["Developer Mode provides additional debugging features:\n","El Modo Desarrollador proporciona funciones adicionales de depuración:\n"],["• Developer Console (F12)\n","• Consola de Desarrollador (F12)\n"],["• Inspect Element (Right-click)\n","• Inspeccionar Elemento (Clic derecho)\n"],["• Network Monitor\n","• Monitor de Red\n"],["• Performance Profiler\n\n","• Perfilador de Rendimiento\n\n"],["Do you want to upgrade to NW.js Developer Mode?\n","¿Deseas actualizar al Modo Desarrollador de NW.js?\n"],["(Recommended for better debugging experience)","(Recomendado para una mejor experiencia de depuración)"],["The game will be upgraded to NW.js SDK version","El juego será actualizado a la versión SDK de NW.js"],["This may take a few minutes. Please wait...","Esto puede tomar unos minutos. Por favor espera..."],["NW.js has been upgraded to Developer Mode successfully!","¡NW.js ha sido actualizado al Modo Desarrollador exitosamente!"],["Failed to upgrade to Developer Mode:\n","Fallo al actualizar al Modo Desarrollador:\n"],["Error installing debug options: ","Error instalando opciones de depuración: "],["Install Debug Options","Instalar Opciones de Depuración"],["This will install a debug menu into your RPG Maker MV/MZ game.","Esto instalará un menú de depuración en tu juego de RPG Maker MV/MZ."],["Select the game executable file to install debug options.","Selecciona el archivo ejecutable del juego para instalar opciones de depuración."],["Compile HTML to Executable","Compilar HTML a Ejecutable"],["Change Existing NWJS Version","Cambiar Versión Existente de NWJS"],["Install debug options","Instalar opciones de depuración"],["Find next","Buscar siguiente"],["Open folder","Abrir carpeta"],["Open with external application","Abrir con aplicación externa"],["Raw JSON data. Right click to open menu.","Datos JSON en bruto. Haz clic derecho para abrir el menú."],["Patch is available for this trans data. This patch will make your trans data compatible with the current version of Translator++.\nDo you want to patch your Trans data?\n(Some feature may not work properly if you don't patch your trans data)","Hay un parche disponible para estos datos de traducción. Este parche hará que tus datos de traducción sean compatibles con la versión actual de Translator++.\n¿Quieres aplicar el parche a tus datos de traducción?\n(Algunas funciones pueden no funcionar correctamente si no aplicas el parche a tus datos de traducción)"],["Unable to locate executable to install debug options. Make sure your game is packaged for Windows with NW.js.","No se puede localizar el ejecutable para instalar opciones de depuración. Asegúrate de que tu juego esté empaquetado para Windows con NW.js."],["Error while installing debug options: ","Error al instalar opciones de depuración: "],["Play last build","Reproducir última compilación"],["Dev path is not defined.\nYou should inject your game once to generate dev path.","La ruta de desarrollo no está definida.\nDeberías inyectar tu juego una vez para generar la ruta de desarrollo."],["Open editor","Abrir editor"],["Load Plugins Into Project","Cargar Plugins en el Proyecto"],["Compile Game","Compilar Juego"],["The option has been set to use the legacy parser.\nYou can switch back to the new parser anytime via option menu.","La opción se ha configurado para usar el analizador heredado.\nPuedes volver al nuevo analizador en cualquier momento a través del menú de opciones."],["Unable to find the file related to the data","No se puede encontrar el archivo relacionado con los datos"],["To fix this correct the <b>Raw material location</b> field at the <a href=\"#\" class=\"openProjectProperties\">Project properties</a>","Para solucionar esto, corrige el campo <b>Ubicación de material en bruto</b> en las <a href=\"#\" class=\"openProjectProperties\">Propiedades del proyecto</a>"],["Maximum dialog line","Línea máxima de diálogo"],["Maximum line in the dialog box. Default is 4.","Líneas máximas en el cuadro de diálogo. Por defecto es 4."],["Add debug options","Agregar opciones de depuración"],["Add debug options into the game to help testing.","Agregar opciones de depuración al juego para ayudar en las pruebas."],["Enable this option to add debugging tools to the game. These features can help you test your translation.<br/><b>⚠️ Note: This option is only available if your game is packaged with NWJS for Windows.</b>","Habilita esta opción para añadir herramientas de depuración al juego. Estas características pueden ayudarte a probar tu traducción.<br/><b>⚠️ Nota: Esta opción solo está disponible si tu juego está empaquetado con NWJS para Windows.</b>"]],"context":[["tid/125/type/StringLiteral","tid/152/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/135/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/16151/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/19426/type/StringLiteral","tid/19469/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20448/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20619/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20624/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20635/type/StringLiteral","tid/21231/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20640/type/StringLiteral","tid/21236/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20713/type/StringLiteral","tid/30541/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20814/type/StringLiteral","tid/21410/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20865/type/StringLiteral","tid/21461/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20925/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20962/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/20992/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21023/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21215/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21220/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21309/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21564/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21678/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22062/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22163/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22214/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22424/type/StringLiteral","tid/24166/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22434/type/StringLiteral","tid/24176/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22468/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22478/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22512/type/StringLiteral","tid/22962/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22522/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22533/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22560/type/StringLiteral","tid/22986/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22570/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22605/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/22610/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23014/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23119/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23148/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23298/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23453/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23555/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23696/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23770/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23812/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23820/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23828/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23836/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23844/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23852/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23860/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23868/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23922/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23931/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/23972/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24005/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24068/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24217/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate","tid/24282/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/24222/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/24227/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/24482/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24546/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24598/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24781/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24891/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/24981/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/25166/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/26021/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/29743/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/29779/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30242/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30291/type/StringLiteral","tid/30388/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30339/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30443/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30705/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/30891/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/31622/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/31627/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/32659/type/StringLiteral","tid/32882/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/32669/type/StringLiteral","tid/32892/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/32935/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/32945/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/33021/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"rmmv.js","dirname":"/addons/rmmv","extension":".js","filename":"rmmv.js","path":"/addons/rmmv/rmmv.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Beautify JSON data":0,"When checked the generated data will be beautified.":1,"Error loading system.json":2,"Loading":3,"index.html not found in":4,"Encrypted game":5,"Select the index.html of your encrypted game.":6,"Target folder":7,"Select destination folder. The process will replace the existing files.":8,"Decrypt Resources":9,"Close":10,"Process":11,"Source path can not empty":12,"Destination path can not empty":13,"Path is not a file:":14,"Invalid directory:":15,"Extract enigma":16,"Select enigma file.":17,"Extract Enigma":18,"Selected file is not an Enigma Virtual Box package.":19,"Plugins are already fetched for this project. Want to re-fetch the plugins?":20,"Translate Javascript File?":21,"Cancel":22,"I know the risk, Proceed!":23,"Game Executable Path":24,"Path to the game executable file (.exe)":25,"NWJS Version":26,"Change into this NWJS version":27,"Use Developer version":28,"Use the NWJS Developer version. The Developer version has developer tools available. Suitable for debugging and development.":29,"In Developer version you can use <b>Developer Console</b>. Developer Console can be accessed by pressing F12 or right-clicking the app and selecting 'Inspect'.":30,"Use 32-bit version":31,"Use the 32-bit version of NWJS. The 32-bit version is useful for compatibility with older systems. It is recommended to uncheck this option if possible (just upgrade your machine, dude).":32,"Some game feature may not work across NWJS version":33,"Please be aware that some game feature may not work across NWJS version.":34,"Change RPG Maker MV / RPG Maker MZ / NWJS version":35,"This operation will change the NW.js version into":36,"Please close the application first before continuing.\nDo you want to continue?":37,"The selected file is not a valid NW.js application.":38,"Could not find index.html in the game directory.":39,"Debug menu script not found in addon directory.":40,"Debug menu script is already installed in index.html.":41,"Debug options installed successfully!":42,"The selected game is not running in NW.js Developer Mode (SDK).\n\n":43,"Developer Mode provides additional debugging features:\n":44,"• Developer Console (F12)\n":45,"• Inspect Element (Right-click)\n":46,"• Network Monitor\n":47,"• Performance Profiler\n\n":48,"Do you want to upgrade to NW.js Developer Mode?\n":49,"(Recommended for better debugging experience)":50,"The game will be upgraded to NW.js SDK version":51,"This may take a few minutes. Please wait...":52,"NW.js has been upgraded to Developer Mode successfully!":53,"Failed to upgrade to Developer Mode:\n":54,"Error installing debug options: ":55,"Install Debug Options":56,"This will install a debug menu into your RPG Maker MV/MZ game.":57,"Select the game executable file to install debug options.":58,"Compile HTML to Executable":59,"Change Existing NWJS Version":60,"Install debug options":61,"Find next":62,"Open folder":63,"Open with external application":64,"Raw JSON data. Right click to open menu.":65,"Patch is available for this trans data. This patch will make your trans data compatible with the current version of Translator++.\nDo you want to patch your Trans data?\n(Some feature may not work properly if you don't patch your trans data)":66,"Unable to locate executable to install debug options. Make sure your game is packaged for Windows with NW.js.":67,"Error while installing debug options: ":68,"Play last build":69,"Dev path is not defined.\nYou should inject your game once to generate dev path.":70,"Open editor":71,"Load Plugins Into Project":72,"Compile Game":73,"The option has been set to use the legacy parser.\nYou can switch back to the new parser anytime via option menu.":74,"Unable to find the file related to the data":75,"To fix this correct the <b>Raw material location</b> field at the <a href=\"#\" class=\"openProjectProperties\">Project properties</a>":76,"Maximum dialog line":77,"Maximum line in the dialog box. Default is 4.":78,"Add debug options":79,"Add debug options into the game to help testing.":80,"Enable this option to add debugging tools to the game. These features can help you test your translation.<br/><b>⚠️ Note: This option is only available if your game is packaged with NWJS for Windows.</b>":81},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rmmv/src/dv-debugmenu-map-preview.js":{"data":[["This feature only available if you are using Developer version of NWJS.","Esta característica solo está disponible si estás usando la versión de desarrollador de NWJS."]],"context":[["tid/19679/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"dv-debugmenu-map-preview.js","dirname":"/addons/rmmv/src","extension":".js","filename":"dv-debugmenu-map-preview.js","path":"/addons/rmmv/src/dv-debugmenu-map-preview.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"This feature only available if you are using Developer version of NWJS.":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rmmv/src/dv-debugmenu.js":{"data":[["This feature only available if you are using developer version of NW.js.","Esta característica solo está disponible si estás usando la versión de desarrollador de NW.js."]],"context":[["tid/22924/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"dv-debugmenu.js","dirname":"/addons/rmmv/src","extension":".js","filename":"dv-debugmenu.js","path":"/addons/rmmv/src/dv-debugmenu.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"This feature only available if you are using developer version of NW.js.":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rmrgss/RMUtil.js":{"data":[["Use legacy parser","Usar analizador legado"],["Use the old parser prior to (Translator++ ver. 3.8.12). The old parser doesn't support some newly added features.","Usa el analizador antiguo anterior a (Translator++ ver. 3.8.12). El analizador antiguo no soporta algunas características añadidas recientemente."],["Use old parser","Usar analizador antiguo"],["Event's thread concurrency","Concurrencia de hilos de eventos"],["<b>Warning! Experimental feature!</b><br />This option determines the maximum number of worker threads that can concurrently parse event data on the Map and CommonEvents. <b>Set to 0 to disable worker thread</b>. <br />This option has the potential to accelerate the parsing process in larger games. However, it is important to note that in smaller games, enabling this option may actually slow down the parsing process due to the higher execution overhead compared to the parsing time for each data.","<b>¡Advertencia! ¡Característica experimental!</b><br />Esta opción determina el número máximo de hilos de trabajo que pueden analizar datos de eventos concurrentemente en Mapas y CommonEvents. <b>Establece en 0 para deshabilitar los hilos de trabajo</b>. <br />Esta opción tiene el potencial de acelerar el proceso de análisis en juegos más grandes. Sin embargo, es importante notar que en juegos más pequeños, habilitar esta opción puede ralentizar el proceso de análisis debido al mayor costo de ejecución comparado con el tiempo de análisis para cada dato."],["The minimum number of command in an event that allowed in thread worker","El número mínimo de comandos en un evento permitido en un hilo de trabajo"],["<b>Warning! Experimental feature!</b><br />Thread workers incur overhead during execution, which means that processing blank events or events with a low number of commands can actually hinder the overall process. This option enables you to specify the minimum number of commands an event must have in order to be parsed in a worker thread. <br />It is important to note that even blank events contain one command, and it is more efficient to process such events in the main thread rather than in a worker thread. Therefore, it is recommended to set this number to a value <b>greater than 1</b>.<br />Set to 0 to disable splitting task based on commands.","<b>¡Advertencia! ¡Característica experimental!</b><br />Los hilos de trabajo incurren en un costo durante la ejecución, lo que significa que procesar eventos vacíos o eventos con un bajo número de comandos puede entorpecer el proceso general. Esta opción te permite especificar el número mínimo de comandos que un evento debe tener para ser analizado en un hilo de trabajo. <br />Es importante notar que incluso los eventos vacíos contienen un comando, y es más eficiente procesar tales eventos en el hilo principal en lugar de en un hilo de trabajo. Por lo tanto, se recomienda establecer este número a un valor <b>mayor que 1</b>.<br />Establece en 0 para deshabilitar la división de tareas basada en comandos."],["Note that a blank event actually contains one command, and you definitely want to process blank events in the main thread instead of a worker thread. You should set this number to a value greater than 1.","Nota que un evento vacío en realidad contiene un comando, y definitivamente querrás procesar eventos vacíos en el hilo principal en lugar de en un hilo de trabajo. Debes establecer este número a un valor mayor que 1."],["RPG Maker XP, VX, Ace, MV & MZ Parser V.3","Analizador de RPG Maker XP, VX, Ace, MV & MZ V.3"],["Start translation from RPG Maker game using the latest parser.","Comenzar traducción desde un juego de RPG Maker usando el analizador más reciente."],["Error!\r\nTranslator++ is unable to detect the type of ","¡Error!\r\nTranslator++ no puede detectar el tipo de "],["You should change the path!\r\nThe Dev directory should not inside the original game's directory, as this will cause problem if you inject the game latter.","¡Deberías cambiar la ruta!\r\nEl directorio Dev no debe estar dentro del directorio del juego original, ya que esto causará problemas si inyectas el juego después."],["The game is packed with Enigma.\r\nDo you want to extract the package?\r\nThis will take minutes, depend on the size of your game.","El juego está empaquetado con Enigma.\r\n¿Quieres extraer el paquete?\r\nEsto tomará minutos, dependiendo del tamaño de tu juego."],["Unable to extract the Enigma package!","¡No se pudo extraer el paquete de Enigma!"],["Copy & extract data into ","Copiar y extraer datos en"]],"context":[["tid/263/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/273/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/290/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/344/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/354/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/424/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/434/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/438/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21951/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/21956/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22453/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/22989/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23038/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23126/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/23333/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"RMUtil.js","dirname":"/addons/rmrgss","extension":".js","filename":"RMUtil.js","path":"/addons/rmrgss/RMUtil.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Use legacy parser":0,"Use the old parser prior to (Translator++ ver. 3.8.12). The old parser doesn't support some newly added features.":1,"Use old parser":2,"Event's thread concurrency":3,"<b>Warning! Experimental feature!</b><br />This option determines the maximum number of worker threads that can concurrently parse event data on the Map and CommonEvents. <b>Set to 0 to disable worker thread</b>. <br />This option has the potential to accelerate the parsing process in larger games. However, it is important to note that in smaller games, enabling this option may actually slow down the parsing process due to the higher execution overhead compared to the parsing time for each data.":4,"The minimum number of command in an event that allowed in thread worker":5,"<b>Warning! Experimental feature!</b><br />Thread workers incur overhead during execution, which means that processing blank events or events with a low number of commands can actually hinder the overall process. This option enables you to specify the minimum number of commands an event must have in order to be parsed in a worker thread. <br />It is important to note that even blank events contain one command, and it is more efficient to process such events in the main thread rather than in a worker thread. Therefore, it is recommended to set this number to a value <b>greater than 1</b>.<br />Set to 0 to disable splitting task based on commands.":6,"Note that a blank event actually contains one command, and you definitely want to process blank events in the main thread instead of a worker thread. You should set this number to a value greater than 1.":7,"RPG Maker XP, VX, Ace, MV & MZ Parser V.3":8,"Start translation from RPG Maker game using the latest parser.":9,"Error!\r\nTranslator++ is unable to detect the type of ":10,"You should change the path!\r\nThe Dev directory should not inside the original game's directory, as this will cause problem if you inject the game latter.":11,"The game is packed with Enigma.\r\nDo you want to extract the package?\r\nThis will take minutes, depend on the size of your game.":12,"Unable to extract the Enigma package!":13,"Copy & extract data into ":14},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/rmrgss/legacyHandler.js":{"data":[["RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is needed to run this action.\nRPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is licensed under GPL-3 and cannot be distributed along with the program.\nBut Translator++ can set it up on your behalf.\n\nDo you wan't Translator++ to install RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway for you?","Se necesita RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway para ejecutar esta acción.\nRPGMakertrans CLI Gateway está licenciado bajo GPL-3 y no puede distribuirse junto con el programa.\nPero Translator++ puede configurarlo en su nombre.\n\n¿Quiere que Translator++ instale RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway para usted?"],["RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is need to be updated.\nDo you wan't Translator++ to update the RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway for you?","RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway necesita ser actualizado.\n¿Quiere que Translator++ actualice RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway para usted?"],["Maximum dialog line","Línea máxima de diálogo"],["Maximum line in the dialog box. Default is 4.","Línea máxima en la caja de diálogo. Por defecto es 4."]],"context":[["tid/569/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/644/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4420/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4430/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"legacyHandler.js","dirname":"/addons/rmrgss","extension":".js","filename":"legacyHandler.js","path":"/addons/rmrgss/legacyHandler.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is needed to run this action.\nRPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is licensed under GPL-3 and cannot be distributed along with the program.\nBut Translator++ can set it up on your behalf.\n\nDo you wan't Translator++ to install RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway for you?":0,"RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway is need to be updated.\nDo you wan't Translator++ to update the RPGMakertrans CLI Gateway for you?":1,"Maximum dialog line":2,"Maximum line in the dialog box. Default is 4.":3},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/srpgStudioParser/srpgstudio.js":{"data":[["Start a translation project from SRPG Studio Engine.","Iniciar un proyecto de traducción desde SRPG Studio Engine."],["The parser can handle translation from <b>data.dts</b> (srpgs file); the <b>localization.dat</b> file and localization files (.json, .txt, .js) generated by SRPG Studio's localization tool introduced in version 1.253..","El analizador puede manejar traducciones desde <b>data.dts</b> (archivo srpgs); el archivo <b>localization.dat</b> y los archivos de localización (.json, .txt, .js) generados por la herramienta de localización de SRPG Studio introducida en la versión 1.253."],["Create project","Crear proyecto"],["Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!","Error: customField no está definido. ¡Esto no debería pasar!"],["Please select the entry point to translate.","Por favor, seleccione el punto de entrada para traducir."],["There are currently two known locations of translatable text within the SRPG Studio game. <br />","Actualmente hay dos ubicaciones conocidas de texto traducible dentro del juego SRPG Studio. <br />"],["The first is directly written inside the .srpgs file, and the second is in the localization.dat file. This parser can currently can handle both.","La primera está escrita directamente dentro del archivo .srpgs, y la segunda está en el archivo localization.dat. Este analizador actualmente puede manejar ambas."],["<br />In addition to that, you can also translate the localization files generated by SRPG Studio's localization tool. These files are in JSON, TXT, and JS format.","<br />Además de eso, también puede traducir los archivos de localización generados por la herramienta de localización de SRPG Studio. Estos archivos están en formato JSON, TXT y JS."]],"context":[["tid/2574/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2579/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2648/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2685/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2745/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3047/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3054/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/3061/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"srpgstudio.js","dirname":"/addons/srpgStudioParser","extension":".js","filename":"srpgstudio.js","path":"/addons/srpgStudioParser/srpgstudio.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Start a translation project from SRPG Studio Engine.":0,"The parser can handle translation from <b>data.dts</b> (srpgs file); the <b>localization.dat</b> file and localization files (.json, .txt, .js) generated by SRPG Studio's localization tool introduced in version 1.253..":1,"Create project":2,"Error: customField is not defined. This should not happen!":3,"Please select the entry point to translate.":4,"There are currently two known locations of translatable text within the SRPG Studio game. <br />":5,"The first is directly written inside the .srpgs file, and the second is in the localization.dat file. This parser can currently can handle both.":6,"<br />In addition to that, you can also translate the localization files generated by SRPG Studio's localization tool. These files are in JSON, TXT, and JS format.":7},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/srpgStudioParserAlt/srpgstudio-alt.js":{"data":[["Parse SRPG Studio archives and translation dump JSON generated by SRPG_Unpacker.exe.","Analizar archivos de SRPG Studio y volcado de traducción JSON generado por SRPG_Unpacker.exe."],["Start translation from SRPG Studio data.dts, project.dat, or translation dump JSON.<br />This is the latest parser—significantly faster and more stable—which will replace the previous version.","Iniciar traducción desde data.dts de SRPG Studio, project.dat, o volcado de traducción JSON.<br />Este es el analizador más reciente—significativamente más rápido y estable—que reemplazará la versión anterior."],["Create Project","Crear Proyecto"],["Source mode","Modo de fuente"],["Choose EXE mode to start from the game executable, archive mode for data.dts / project.dat, or dump mode for translation dump JSON.","Elija modo EXE para comenzar desde el ejecutable del juego, modo archivo para data.dts / project.dat, o modo volcado para volcado de traducción JSON."],["Select executable","Seleccionar ejecutable"],["Select the game executable. Translator++ will look for data.dts in the same folder.","Seleccione el ejecutable del juego. Translator++ buscará data.dts en la misma carpeta."],["Select archive file","Seleccionar archivo de compresión"],["Select data.dts directly.","Seleccionar data.dts directamente."],["Select dump folder","Seleccionar carpeta de volcado"],["Select the translation dump folder generated by SRPG_Unpacker.exe.","Seleccionar la carpeta de volcado de traducción generada por SRPG_Unpacker.exe."],["Filters","Filtros"],["Glob pattern used to select JSON files from the dump folder.","Patrón global usado para seleccionar archivos JSON de la carpeta de volcado."],["ProjectTitle","Título del Proyecto"],["Your project title","Tu título de proyecto"]],"context":[["tid/4165/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4208/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4279/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4550/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4582/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4608/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4618/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4651/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4661/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4694/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4704/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4737/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4747/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4780/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4790/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"srpgstudio-alt.js","dirname":"/addons/srpgStudioParserAlt","extension":".js","filename":"srpgstudio-alt.js","path":"/addons/srpgStudioParserAlt/srpgstudio-alt.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Parse SRPG Studio archives and translation dump JSON generated by SRPG_Unpacker.exe.":0,"Start translation from SRPG Studio data.dts, project.dat, or translation dump JSON.<br />This is the latest parser—significantly faster and more stable—which will replace the previous version.":1,"Create Project":2,"Source mode":3,"Choose EXE mode to start from the game executable, archive mode for data.dts / project.dat, or dump mode for translation dump JSON.":4,"Select executable":5,"Select the game executable. Translator++ will look for data.dts in the same folder.":6,"Select archive file":7,"Select data.dts directly.":8,"Select dump folder":9,"Select the translation dump folder generated by SRPG_Unpacker.exe.":10,"Filters":11,"Glob pattern used to select JSON files from the dump folder.":12,"ProjectTitle":13,"Your project title":14},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/sugoiTrans/serverManager.html":{"data":[["Sugoi translator location <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Point to the .bat file or .exe file on the root directory of the application.\"></i>","Ubicación de Sugoi translator <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Apunte al archivo .bat o .exe en el directorio raíz de la aplicación.\"></i>"],["<i class=\"icon-attention red\"></i> Invalid path.<br>Some features will be disabled until this is fixed.","<i class=\"icon-attention red\"></i> Ruta inválida.<br>Algunas funciones se desactivarán hasta que esto se solucione."],["Server Type :","Tipo de Servidor :"],["Installed Model :","Modelo Instalado :"],["Install Sugoi Translator","Instalar Sugoi Translator"],["Don't have Sugoi Translator?\n            Install customized &amp; optimized Sugoi Translator server now!\n        ","¿No tienes Sugoi Translator?\n            ¡Instala el servidor de Sugoi Translator personalizado y optimizado ahora!"],["Number of server to start (CPU) <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Number of server started simultaneously\"></i>","Número de servidores a iniciar (CPU) <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Número de servidores iniciados simultáneamente\"></i>"],["Number of server to be started simultaneously.<br>More process desn't always means more speed, be mindful of your RAM &amp; CPU capacity.<br>You may won't get the benefit if by running just one server the CPU usage has reached 100%","Número de servidores a iniciar simultáneamente.<br>Más procesos no siempre significa más velocidad, ten en cuenta tu capacidad de RAM y CPU.<br>Puede que no obtengas beneficio si al ejecutar solo un servidor el uso de CPU ha alcanzado el 100%"],["\n                    Your Sugoi Translator doesn't support GPU processing.<br>\n                    You need to patch your server to support GPU processing.<br>\n                    <h3 data-tran=\"\">Select the following option to install the suitable patch for your system</h3>\n                    <div>\n                        <span data-tran=\"\">Your GPU is:</span>\n                        <ul class=\"gpuList\"></ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"gpuPatchOptions\">\n                        <button class=\"patchGPU\" data-tran=\"\">Install patch For NVIDIA series 30xx or greater</button>\n                        <button class=\"patchGPULegacy\" data-tran=\"\">Install patch For NVIDIA series 20xx or lower</button>\n    \n                    </div>\n                ","\n                    Tu Sugoi Translator no soporta procesamiento por GPU.<br>\n                    Necesitas parchear tu servidor para soportar procesamiento por GPU.<br>\n                    <h3 data-tran=\"\">Selecciona la siguiente opción para instalar el parche adecuado para tu sistema</h3>\n                    <div>\n                        <span data-tran=\"\">Tu GPU es:</span>\n                        <ul class=\"gpuList\"></ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"gpuPatchOptions\">\n                        <button class=\"patchGPU\" data-tran=\"\">Instalar parche para NVIDIA serie 30xx o superior</button>\n                        <button class=\"patchGPULegacy\" data-tran=\"\">Instalar parche para NVIDIA serie 20xx o inferior</button>\n    \n                    </div>\n                "],["Select the following option to install the suitable patch for your system","Selecciona la siguiente opción para instalar el parche adecuado para tu sistema"],["Your GPU is:","Tu GPU es:"],["Install patch For NVIDIA series 30xx or greater","Instalar parche para NVIDIA serie 30xx o superior"],["Install patch For NVIDIA series 20xx or lower","Instalar parche para series NVIDIA 20xx o inferiores"],["Number of server to start (GPU) <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Number of server started simultaneously using GPU. Your server must be patched to enable GPU processing.\"></i>","Número de servidores a iniciar (GPU) <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Número de servidores iniciados simultáneamente usando GPU. Tu servidor debe estar parcheado para habilitar el procesamiento GPU.\"></i>"],["How many server do you want to start on your <b>GPU</b>. It is possible to run both CPU and GPU based service simultaneously. But please keep in mind that if your CPU usage is high it may hinder the GPU performance.<br>Your server must be patched to enable this mode.","Cuántos servidores quieres iniciar en tu <b>GPU</b>. Es posible ejecutar servicios basados en CPU y GPU simultáneamente. Pero ten en cuenta que si el uso de tu CPU es alto, puede afectar el rendimiento de la GPU.<br>Tu servidor debe estar parcheado para habilitar este modo."],["Starting port number","Número de puerto inicial"],["The port numbers will be generated incrementaly starting from the value below","Los números de puerto se generarán incrementalmente a partir del valor a continuación"],["Keep console window open","Mantener ventana de consola abierta"],["prevent console window from closing when the server closes. This option is useful for checking for errors that caused the server to crash.","evitar que la ventana de consola se cierre cuando el servidor se cierra. Esta opción es útil para verificar errores que causaron la caída del servidor."],["Action","Acción"],["Set Sugoi Trans config based on this setting","Configurar Sugoi Trans basado en esta configuración"],["Start All Server","Iniciar todos los servidores"]],"context":[["idx/0/innerText"],["idx/1/innerText"],["idx/2/innerText"],["idx/3/innerText"],["idx/4/innerText","idx/6/innerText"],["idx/5/innerText"],["idx/7/innerText"],["idx/8/innerText"],["idx/9/innerText"],["idx/10/innerText"],["idx/11/innerText"],["idx/12/innerText"],["idx/13/innerText"],["idx/14/innerText"],["idx/15/innerText"],["idx/16/innerText"],["idx/17/innerText"],["idx/18/innerText"],["idx/19/innerText"],["idx/20/innerText"],["idx/21/innerText"],["idx/22/innerText"]],"basename":"serverManager.html","dirname":"/addons/sugoiTrans","extension":".html","filename":"serverManager.html","path":"/addons/sugoiTrans/serverManager.html","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Sugoi translator location <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Point to the .bat file or .exe file on the root directory of the application.\"></i>":0,"<i class=\"icon-attention red\"></i> Invalid path.<br>Some features will be disabled until this is fixed.":1,"Server Type :":2,"Installed Model :":3,"Install Sugoi Translator":4,"Don't have Sugoi Translator?\n            Install customized &amp; optimized Sugoi Translator server now!\n        ":5,"Number of server to start (CPU) <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Number of server started simultaneously\"></i>":6,"Number of server to be started simultaneously.<br>More process desn't always means more speed, be mindful of your RAM &amp; CPU capacity.<br>You may won't get the benefit if by running just one server the CPU usage has reached 100%":7,"\n                    Your Sugoi Translator doesn't support GPU processing.<br>\n                    You need to patch your server to support GPU processing.<br>\n                    <h3 data-tran=\"\">Select the following option to install the suitable patch for your system</h3>\n                    <div>\n                        <span data-tran=\"\">Your GPU is:</span>\n                        <ul class=\"gpuList\"></ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div class=\"gpuPatchOptions\">\n                        <button class=\"patchGPU\" data-tran=\"\">Install patch For NVIDIA series 30xx or greater</button>\n                        <button class=\"patchGPULegacy\" data-tran=\"\">Install patch For NVIDIA series 20xx or lower</button>\n    \n                    </div>\n                ":8,"Select the following option to install the suitable patch for your system":9,"Your GPU is:":10,"Install patch For NVIDIA series 30xx or greater":11,"Install patch For NVIDIA series 20xx or lower":12,"Number of server to start (GPU) <i class=\"icon-info-circled-1\" data-tranatrr=\"title\" title=\"Number of server started simultaneously using GPU. Your server must be patched to enable GPU processing.\"></i>":13,"How many server do you want to start on your <b>GPU</b>. It is possible to run both CPU and GPU based service simultaneously. But please keep in mind that if your CPU usage is high it may hinder the GPU performance.<br>Your server must be patched to enable this mode.":14,"Starting port number":15,"The port numbers will be generated incrementaly starting from the value below":16,"Keep console window open":17,"prevent console window from closing when the server closes. This option is useful for checking for errors that caused the server to crash.":18,"Action":19,"Set Sugoi Trans config based on this setting":20,"Start All Server":21},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/sugoiTrans/serverManager.js":{"data":[["Select installation folder","Seleccionar carpeta de instalación"],["Where do you want to install the CT2 Sugoi Translator into?","¿Dónde quieres instalar el CT2 Sugoi Translator?"],["Cancel","Cancelar"],["Install now!","¡Instalar ahora!"],["Path to the directory can not be empty!","La ruta al directorio no puede estar vacía!"],["Invalid directory:","Directorio inválido:"],["Failed to download file. Repository do not exist. Please see the console log for more information.","Error al descargar archivo. El repositorio no existe. Por favor, consulta el registro de la consola para más información."],["Are you sure want to update your server?\nThis update script will work for NVIDIA 3XXX series","¿Estás seguro de que quieres actualizar tu servidor?\nEste script de actualización funcionará para series NVIDIA 3XXX"],["Are you sure want to update your server?\nThis update script will work for NVIDIA 2XXX series and earlier","¿Estás seguro de que quieres actualizar tu servidor?\nEste script de actualización funcionará para series NVIDIA 2XXX y anteriores"],["Install CT2 Sugoi Translator","Instalar CT2 Sugoi Translator"],["Installation completed\nDo you want to set the Server Manager with this installed server?","Instalación completada\n¿Desea configurar el Administrador del Servidor con este servidor instalado?"],["Sugoi Translator Installed","Sugoi Translator Instalado"],["Server started\nPlease wait until the server(s) are ready before you translate things.","Servidor iniciado\nEspere a que el(los) servidor(es) estén listos antes de traducir."],["This action will overwrite the current value of Sugoi Trans Addon's settings.\nAre you sure?","Esta acción sobrescribirá el valor actual de la configuración del complemento Sugoi Trans.\n¿Está seguro?"],["Do you want to reset the current configuration?","¿Desea restablecer la configuración actual?"],["Configuration refreshed!","¡Configuración actualizada!"]],"context":[["tid/528/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate","tid/635/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/533/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/766/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/817/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/900/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/929/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1552/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/6226/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/6296/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/8731/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/8957/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9003/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9606/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9643/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/9713/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/9778/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"serverManager.js","dirname":"/addons/sugoiTrans","extension":".js","filename":"serverManager.js","path":"/addons/sugoiTrans/serverManager.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Select installation folder":0,"Where do you want to install the CT2 Sugoi Translator into?":1,"Cancel":2,"Install now!":3,"Path to the directory can not be empty!":4,"Invalid directory:":5,"Failed to download file. Repository do not exist. Please see the console log for more information.":6,"Are you sure want to update your server?\nThis update script will work for NVIDIA 3XXX series":7,"Are you sure want to update your server?\nThis update script will work for NVIDIA 2XXX series and earlier":8,"Install CT2 Sugoi Translator":9,"Installation completed\nDo you want to set the Server Manager with this installed server?":10,"Sugoi Translator Installed":11,"Server started\nPlease wait until the server(s) are ready before you translate things.":12,"This action will overwrite the current value of Sugoi Trans Addon's settings.\nAre you sure?":13,"Do you want to reset the current configuration?":14,"Configuration refreshed!":15},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/sugoiTrans/sugoiTrans.js":{"data":[["Line delimiter","Delimitador de línea"],["Fill in with the characters or phrases that will be escaped by the translator (the original phrase and the translation will always be the same). This will guarantee that the number of lines of the translated text is the same as the number of lines of the original text. \nThere are currently no phrases/characters that Sugoi will escape with a 100% success rate.\nYou can try using &#x3C;br&#x3E; with decent amount of success rate.\nLeave blank if you want to concatenate the lines into a single line.","Complete con los caracteres o frases que serán escapados por el traductor (la frase original y la traducción siempre serán iguales). Esto garantizará que el número de líneas del texto traducido sea el mismo que el del texto original.\nActualmente no hay frases/caracteres que Sugoi escape con un 100% de éxito.\nPuede intentar usar &#x3C;br&#x3E; con una tasa de éxito decente.\nDeje en blanco si desea concatenar las líneas en una sola línea."],["Target URL(s)","URL(s) de destino"],["Translator target URL. You can enter one ore more Sugoi Translator back-end URL. Translator++ will load balance the request across all instance of the services. Separate each entry with a new line.","URL de destino del traductor. Puede ingresar una o más URL del backend de Sugoi Translator. Translator++ distribuirá las solicitudes entre todas las instancias de los servicios. Separe cada entrada con una nueva línea."],["Max Parallel job","Máximo de trabajos paralelos"],["Maximum parallel job that run simultaneously.","Máximo de trabajos paralelos que se ejecutan simultáneamente."],["Send requests in batch","Enviar solicitudes en lote"],["Send several texts (by Max Parallel job) in array.\nFaster and can cut the execution overhead significantly. You must run the server from server manager to enable this option.","Enviar varios textos (según el Máximo de trabajos paralelos) en un arreglo.\nMás rápido y puede reducir significativamente la sobrecarga de ejecución. Debe ejecutar el servidor desde el administrador de servidores para habilitar esta opción."],["Check First Line in Common Reference","Verificar primera línea en Referencia Común"],["Do not include first line in the payload if the first line is found at Common Reference.\nThis is very useful if the character name is at the first line.","No incluir la primera línea en la carga útil si se encuentra en la Referencia Común.\nEsto es muy útil si el nombre del personaje está en la primera línea."],["Check Last Line in Common Reference","Verificar última línea en Referencia Común"],["Do not include last line in the payload if the last line is found at Common Reference.\nThis is very useful if the character name is at the last line.","No incluir la última línea en la carga útil si se encuentra en la Referencia Común.\nEsto es muy útil si el nombre del personaje está en la última línea."],["Automatic splitting","División automática"],["Automatically split the translation into the number of lines matching the original. The length of each line will be of a similar size.","Dividir automáticamente la traducción en el número de líneas que coincida con el original. La longitud de cada línea será de un tamaño similar."],["Code Escaping Algorithm","Algoritmo de Escape de Código"],["Escaping algorithm for inline code inside dialogues (not yet implemented, please wait for the future updates)","Algoritmo de escape para código en línea dentro de diálogos (aún no implementado, por favor espera futuras actualizaciones)"]],"context":[["tid/161/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/171/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/203/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/213/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/257/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/267/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/305/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/315/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/347/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/357/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/389/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/399/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/431/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/441/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/473/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/483/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"sugoiTrans.js","dirname":"/addons/sugoiTrans","extension":".js","filename":"sugoiTrans.js","path":"/addons/sugoiTrans/sugoiTrans.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Line delimiter":0,"Fill in with the characters or phrases that will be escaped by the translator (the original phrase and the translation will always be the same). This will guarantee that the number of lines of the translated text is the same as the number of lines of the original text. \nThere are currently no phrases/characters that Sugoi will escape with a 100% success rate.\nYou can try using &#x3C;br&#x3E; with decent amount of success rate.\nLeave blank if you want to concatenate the lines into a single line.":1,"Target URL(s)":2,"Translator target URL. You can enter one ore more Sugoi Translator back-end URL. Translator++ will load balance the request across all instance of the services. Separate each entry with a new line.":3,"Max Parallel job":4,"Maximum parallel job that run simultaneously.":5,"Send requests in batch":6,"Send several texts (by Max Parallel job) in array.\nFaster and can cut the execution overhead significantly. You must run the server from server manager to enable this option.":7,"Check First Line in Common Reference":8,"Do not include first line in the payload if the first line is found at Common Reference.\nThis is very useful if the character name is at the first line.":9,"Check Last Line in Common Reference":10,"Do not include last line in the payload if the last line is found at Common Reference.\nThis is very useful if the character name is at the last line.":11,"Automatic splitting":12,"Automatically split the translation into the number of lines matching the original. The length of each line will be of a similar size.":13,"Code Escaping Algorithm":14,"Escaping algorithm for inline code inside dialogues (not yet implemented, please wait for the future updates)":15},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/testAddon/emoji.js":{"data":[["Load Actor Reference as Glossary","Cargar Referencia de Actor como Glosario"],["If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.","Si está marcado, Translator++ cargará la referencia del actor como glosario. Esto ayudará al traductor a entender el contexto de la conversación. La referencia del actor es el nombre del actor en el diálogo. Esto se cargará como un glosario para el traductor. Esto aumentará el costo de la traducción."],["Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.","Solo los personajes que existen en la conversación se cargarán como glosario para cada elemento del lote. Usa el comando de plantilla para cargar la referencia del actor en el mensaje de solicitud."],["Actor Reference Translation Column","Columna de Traducción de Referencia de Actor"],["The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.","La columna de la traducción del nombre del actor. Esta columna se usará como la traducción de la referencia del actor. Esto mejorará la consistencia de la traducción del nombre del actor en la conversación."],["Actor's Information Column","Columna de Información del Actor"],["The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.","La columna que contiene información adicional del actor. Puedes poner más información como género, edad, etc. Esto mejorará la traducción de los pronombres en la conversación."],["System Message Template","Plantilla de Mensaje del Sistema"],["System message is the header of the message that will tell what is the role of your chatGPT assistant. This message will be sent as the very first message of every batch you send to chatGPT.","El mensaje del sistema es el encabezado del mensaje que indicará cuál es el rol de tu asistente chatGPT. Este mensaje se enviará como el primer mensaje de cada lote que envíes a chatGPT."],["You can include the following variables with JavaScript's Template Literal style <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>","Puedes incluir las siguientes variables con el estilo de Literal de Plantilla de JavaScript <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>"],["Variables:<br>","Variables:<br>"],["<li>LANG_FROM : Source language</li>","<li>LANG_FROM : Idioma de origen</li>"],["<li>LANG_TO : Target language</li>","<li>LANG_TO : Idioma de destino</li>"],["<li>LANG_FROM_FULL : Full source language name</li>","<li>LANG_FROM_FULL : Nombre completo del idioma de origen</li>"],["<li>LANG_TO_FULL : Full target language name</li>","<li>LANG_TO_FULL : Nombre completo del idioma de destino</li>"],["<li>SOURCE_TEXT : Source text</li>","<li>SOURCE_TEXT : Texto de origen</li>"],["<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : Pre-defined message of escape algorithm.</li>","<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : Mensaje predefinido del algoritmo de escape.</li>"],["<li>NEWLINE_STRING : String represents new line (Line substitute).</li>","<li>NEWLINE_STRING : Cadena que representa nueva línea (sustituto de línea).</li>"],["<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : Number of messages in the batch.</li>","<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : Número de mensajes en el lote.</li>"],["<li>ACTOR_INFO : Add information of the actors.</li>","<li>ACTOR_INFO : Agregar información de los actores.</li>"],["<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>","<li>TITLE : Título del juego</li>"],["<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>","<li>ENGINE : Motor del juego</li>"],["<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>","<li>REFERENCE[nombre del objeto] : Generar referencia desde el objeto de Translator++. <br />Ejemplo : <code>REFERENCE[Referencia Común]</code></li>"],["Body Message Template","Plantilla del Mensaje del Cuerpo"],["Template of the body of your chat.","Plantilla del cuerpo de tu chat."],["Sample conversation","Conversación de ejemplo"],["The ChatGPT Batch API allows you to translate your project asynchronously at 50% lower costs, meaning you will receive the results of your translation <b style=\"color:red\">within 24 hours</b> at <b style=\"color:red\">half the normal cost</b>. This is particularly useful for large projects that do not require immediate translation results.","La API Batch de ChatGPT te permite traducir tu proyecto de forma asíncrona con un 50% menos de costos, lo que significa que recibirás los resultados de tu traducción <b style=\"color:red\">dentro de 24 horas</b> a <b style=\"color:red\">la mitad del costo normal</b>. Esto es especialmente útil para proyectos grandes que no requieren resultados de traducción inmediatos."],[" <br />Read more about the ChatGPT Batch API: https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/batch ."," <br />Lee más sobre la API Batch de ChatGPT: https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/batch ."],["Glossary","Glosario"],["<h2>Glossary</h2>","<h2>Glosario</h2>"],["<p>You may or may not use the glossary. The glossary will be loaded for each batch items to improve the quality of the translation.</p>","<p>Puedes o no usar el glosario. El glosario se cargará para cada elemento del lote para mejorar la calidad de la traducción.</p>"],["The Column of Actor's Additional Information","La Columna de Información Adicional del Actor"],["Prompt Template","Plantilla del Prompt"],["<h2>1. System Message</h2>","<h2>1. Mensaje del Sistema</h2>"],["<p>Here you can explain to the assistant, what is their role.</p>","<p>Aquí puedes explicar al asistente cuál es su rol.</p>"],["<h2>2. Sample dialogue</h2>","<h2>2. Diálogo de ejemplo</h2>"],["<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>","<p>Diálogo existente de ejemplo. Puedes escribir un ejemplo de respuestas buenas o malas para ayudar al traductor a entender tu objetivo y el contexto de la conversación.</p>"],["<h2>3. Your actual prompt</h2>","<h2>3. Tu prompt real</h2>"],["<p>This is the actual prompt to the assistant.</p>","<p>Este es el mensaje real para el asistente.</p>"],["<h3>Overhead cost</h3>\n                        Overhead cost is the cost of the prompt message that you send to the assistant without the actual translation texts. The cost is calculated based on the number of tokens in the prompt message. The more tokens you have, the higher the cost will be.<br>\n                        <b>Current overhead cost:</b> <span class=\"overheadCost\">0</span> tokens / request.","<h3>Costo general</h3>\n                        El costo general es el costo del mensaje de solicitud que envías al asistente sin los textos de traducción reales. El costo se calcula según el número de tokens en el mensaje de solicitud. Cuantos más tokens tengas, mayor será el costo.<br>\n                        <b>Costo general actual:</b> <span class=\"overheadCost\">0</span> tokens / solicitud."]],"context":[["tid/1555/type/StringLiteral","tid/2095/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1565/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1572/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1606/type/StringLiteral","tid/2126/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1616/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1643/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1653/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1685/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1695/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1703/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1711/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1724/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1732/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1740/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1748/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1756/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1764/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1772/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1780/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1788/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1796/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1804/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1812/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1850/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1860/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1906/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2001/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2013/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2039/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2065/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2072/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2157/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2189/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2215/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2222/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2266/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2273/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2399/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2406/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2459/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"]],"basename":"emoji.js","dirname":"/addons/testAddon","extension":".js","filename":"emoji.js","path":"/addons/testAddon/emoji.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Load Actor Reference as Glossary":0,"If checked, Translator++ will load the actor reference as glossary. This will help the translator to understand the context of the conversation. The actor reference is the name of the actor in the dialogue. This will be loaded as a glossary to the translator. This will increase the cost of the translation.":1,"Only the characters that are exists in the conversation will be loaded as glossary for each batch item. Use the template command to load the actor reference in the prompt message.":2,"Actor Reference Translation Column":3,"The column of the translation of the actor name. This column will be used as the translation of the actor reference. This will improve the consistency of actor name's translation in the conversation.":4,"Actor's Information Column":5,"The column that contains the actor's additional information. You can put more information such as gender, age, etc. This will improve the translation of the pronouns in the conversation.":6,"System Message Template":7,"System message is the header of the message that will tell what is the role of your chatGPT assistant. This message will be sent as the very first message of every batch you send to chatGPT.":8,"You can include the following variables with JavaScript's Template Literal style <span class='inlineCode'><b>${</b>VARIABLE<b>}</b></span><br>":9,"Variables:<br>":10,"<li>LANG_FROM : Source language</li>":11,"<li>LANG_TO : Target language</li>":12,"<li>LANG_FROM_FULL : Full source language name</li>":13,"<li>LANG_TO_FULL : Full target language name</li>":14,"<li>SOURCE_TEXT : Source text</li>":15,"<li>ESCAPE_ALGORITHM_PROMPT : Pre-defined message of escape algorithm.</li>":16,"<li>NEWLINE_STRING : String represents new line (Line substitute).</li>":17,"<li>MESSAGE_COUNT : Number of messages in the batch.</li>":18,"<li>ACTOR_INFO : Add information of the actors.</li>":19,"<li>TITLE : Title of the game</li>":20,"<li>ENGINE : Engine of the game</li>":21,"<li>REFERENCE[object name] : Generate reference from Translator++ object. <br />Example : <code>REFERENCE[Common Reference]</code></li>":22,"Body Message Template":23,"Template of the body of your chat.":24,"Sample conversation":25,"The ChatGPT Batch API allows you to translate your project asynchronously at 50% lower costs, meaning you will receive the results of your translation <b style=\"color:red\">within 24 hours</b> at <b style=\"color:red\">half the normal cost</b>. This is particularly useful for large projects that do not require immediate translation results.":26," <br />Read more about the ChatGPT Batch API: https://platform.openai.com/docs/guides/batch .":27,"Glossary":28,"<h2>Glossary</h2>":29,"<p>You may or may not use the glossary. The glossary will be loaded for each batch items to improve the quality of the translation.</p>":30,"The Column of Actor's Additional Information":31,"Prompt Template":32,"<h2>1. System Message</h2>":33,"<p>Here you can explain to the assistant, what is their role.</p>":34,"<h2>2. Sample dialogue</h2>":35,"<p>Sample existing dialog. You can write a sample of good or bad responses to help the translator understand your aim and the context of the conversation.</p>":36,"<h2>3. Your actual prompt</h2>":37,"<p>This is the actual prompt to the assistant.</p>":38,"<h3>Overhead cost</h3>\n                        Overhead cost is the cost of the prompt message that you send to the assistant without the actual translation texts. The cost is calculated based on the number of tokens in the prompt message. The more tokens you have, the higher the cost will be.<br>\n                        <b>Current overhead cost:</b> <span class=\"overheadCost\">0</span> tokens / request.":39},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/tinyrpa/util.js":{"data":[["TinyRPA server is not installed. Do you want to install it now?","El servidor TinyRPA no está instalado. ¿Quieres instalarlo ahora?"]],"context":[["tid/854/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"util.js","dirname":"/addons/tinyrpa","extension":".js","filename":"util.js","path":"/addons/tinyrpa/util.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"TinyRPA server is not installed. Do you want to install it now?":0},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/tm/tm.js":{"data":[["Automatic organic translation memorization","Memorización automática de traducción orgánica"],["If checked, all organic translation (manually inputted translation) will be memorized automatically.","Si está marcado, toda traducción orgánica (traducción ingresada manualmente) se memorizará automáticamente."],["Memorize translation by automation script","Memorizar traducción mediante script de automatización"],["If checked, Translator++ will remember the translation created from automation scripts. \nAll changes via 'this.cells' will be memorized. But it is possible for us to modify the contents of the grid directly using the trans API, such changes will not trigger the automatic memorization.","Si está marcado, Translator++ recordará la traducción creada desde scripts de automatización. \nTodos los cambios a través de 'this.cells' se memorizarán. Pero es posible que modifiquemos el contenido de la cuadrícula directamente usando la API trans, tales cambios no activarán la memorización automática."],["Remind translation on cell translate","Recordar traducción al traducir celda"],["If checked, Translator++ will load translation from translation memory first before performing automatic translation on selected cell.","Si está marcado, Translator++ cargará la traducción de la memoria de traducción primero antes de realizar la traducción automática en la celda seleccionada."],["Default memorization behavior","Comportamiento predeterminado de memorización"],["Overwrite previous record when performing organic translation. If unchecked, TM will not memorize the new translation for existing record.","Sobrescribir registro anterior al realizar traducción orgánica. Si no está marcado, la TM no memorizará la nueva traducción para registros existentes."],["MySQL host","Host de MySQL"],["The host name or IP address of your MySQL server","El nombre de host o dirección IP de tu servidor MySQL"],["MySQL port","Puerto de MySQL"],["MySQL Port. Default is 3306.","Puerto de MySQL. Por defecto es 3306."],["MySQL user name","Nombre de usuario de MySQL"],["Username to access the DB.","Nombre de usuario para acceder a la base de datos."],["MySQL password","Contraseña de MySQL"],["Password to access the DB.","Contraseña para acceder a la base de datos."],["Database Name","Nombre de la base de datos"],["Database name. Translator++ will try to create database if not exist. But the success is depend on the privilege of the given credential.","Nombre de la base de datos. Translator++ intentará crear la base de datos si no existe. Pero el éxito depende de los privilegios de las credenciales proporcionadas."],["Database Type","Tipo de Base de Datos"],["Automatically memorize manually inputted translations?","¿Memorizar automáticamente las traducciones ingresadas manualmente?"],["Sorry, this addon is only available for active patrons only.\nYou can unlock this feature by becoming a $1 patron.","Lo siento, este complemento solo está disponible para patrocinadores activos.\nPuedes desbloquear esta función convirtiéndote en un patrocinador de $1."],["Automatically memorize translation made by automation scripts?","¿Memorizar automáticamente las traducciones hechas por scripts de automatización?"],["Remind translations when performing translate selection?","¿Recordar traducciones al realizar la selección de traducción?"],["Use rememorize in organic translation","Usar rememorización en traducción orgánica"],["default","predeterminado"],["Indexed DB (experimental)","Indexed DB (experimental)"],["MySQL","MySQL"],["Database Setting","Configuración de Base de Datos"],["IndexedDB","IndexedDB"],["Generate","Generar"],["Escaping algorithm for inline code inside dialogues","Algoritmo de escape para código en línea dentro de diálogos"],["Test connection","Probar conexión"],["Connection success!","¡Conexión exitosa!"],["MySql","MySql"],["Connection failed!\nError:","¡Conexión fallida!\nError:"],["Install MySQL Server","Instalar Servidor MySQL"],["How to setup MySQL Server","Cómo configurar Servidor MySQL"],["Multiple translations for one key sentence is detected.\nOnly the last found translation will be memorized by the Translation Memory.\nDo you want to continue?","Se detectaron múltiples traducciones para una frase clave.\nSolo la última traducción encontrada será memorizada por la Memoria de Traducción.\n¿Desea continuar?"],["Your database structure need to be updated.","La estructura de su base de datos necesita ser actualizada."],["Upgrade database","Actualizar base de datos"],["This action will upgrade your database.\nDo you want to upgrade your translation memory database?","Esta acción actualizará su base de datos.\n¿Desea actualizar su base de datos de memoria de traducción?"],["The translation memory database has been upgraded!\nPlease restart Translator++!","¡La base de datos de memoria de traducción ha sido actualizada!\n¡Por favor, reinicie Translator++!"]],"context":[["tid/292/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/302/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/340/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/350/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/388/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/398/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/436/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/446/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/484/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/494/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/532/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/542/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/588/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/598/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/643/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/653/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/698/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/708/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/754/type/StringLiteral","tid/764/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/835/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/878/type/StringLiteral","tid/1008/type/StringLiteral","tid/1138/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/965/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1095/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1225/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1290/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1300/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1310/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1390/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1428/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1459/type/StringLiteral","tid/1938/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1469/type/StringLiteral","tid/1948/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1500/type/StringLiteral","tid/1979/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1523/type/StringLiteral","tid/2093/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1557/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2114/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2153/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2201/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/3362/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4084/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4095/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4123/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/4203/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"tm.js","dirname":"/addons/tm","extension":".js","filename":"tm.js","path":"/addons/tm/tm.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Automatic organic translation memorization":0,"If checked, all organic translation (manually inputted translation) will be memorized automatically.":1,"Memorize translation by automation script":2,"If checked, Translator++ will remember the translation created from automation scripts. \nAll changes via 'this.cells' will be memorized. But it is possible for us to modify the contents of the grid directly using the trans API, such changes will not trigger the automatic memorization.":3,"Remind translation on cell translate":4,"If checked, Translator++ will load translation from translation memory first before performing automatic translation on selected cell.":5,"Default memorization behavior":6,"Overwrite previous record when performing organic translation. If unchecked, TM will not memorize the new translation for existing record.":7,"MySQL host":8,"The host name or IP address of your MySQL server":9,"MySQL port":10,"MySQL Port. Default is 3306.":11,"MySQL user name":12,"Username to access the DB.":13,"MySQL password":14,"Password to access the DB.":15,"Database Name":16,"Database name. Translator++ will try to create database if not exist. But the success is depend on the privilege of the given credential.":17,"Database Type":18,"Automatically memorize manually inputted translations?":19,"Sorry, this addon is only available for active patrons only.\nYou can unlock this feature by becoming a $1 patron.":20,"Automatically memorize translation made by automation scripts?":21,"Remind translations when performing translate selection?":22,"Use rememorize in organic translation":23,"default":24,"Indexed DB (experimental)":25,"MySQL":26,"Database Setting":27,"IndexedDB":28,"Generate":29,"Escaping algorithm for inline code inside dialogues":30,"Test connection":31,"Connection success!":32,"MySql":33,"Connection failed!\nError:":34,"Install MySQL Server":35,"How to setup MySQL Server":36,"Multiple translations for one key sentence is detected.\nOnly the last found translation will be memorized by the Translation Memory.\nDo you want to continue?":37,"Your database structure need to be updated.":38,"Upgrade database":39,"This action will upgrade your database.\nDo you want to upgrade your translation memory database?":40,"The translation memory database has been upgraded!\nPlease restart Translator++!":41},"tags":[],"parameters":[]},"/addons/tm/tmUI.js":{"data":[["Memory","Memoria"],["Fix the problem!","¡Solucione el problema!"],["No exact matches found!","¡No se encontraron coincidencias exactas!"],["Original","Original"],["Translation","Traducción"],["Do you want Translator++ to forget the selected cell(s)?","¿Desea que Translator++ olvide la(s) celda(s) seleccionada(s)?"],["Auto recall","Recuerdo automático"],["Auto memorize organic translation","Memorizar automáticamente traducción orgánica"],["Auto memorize automation","Memorizar automáticamente automatización"],["Use rememorize in organic translation","Usar rememorizar en traducción orgánica"]],"context":[["tid/47/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/534/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/591/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1126/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1131/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/1804/type/NoSubstitutionTemplate"],["tid/2391/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2543/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2686/type/StringLiteral"],["tid/2838/type/StringLiteral"]],"basename":"tmUI.js","dirname":"/addons/tm","extension":".js","filename":"tmUI.js","path":"/addons/tm/tmUI.js","indexIsBuilt":true,"indexIds":{"Memory":0,"Fix the problem!"